        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-10" class="text-slate-400">Nov 10, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/anthropic-ipo-roadshow-nasdaq-ant-70-78/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude&#039;s maker is going public: Anthropic starts its IPO roadshow at $70 to $78 a share, ticker ANT</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic, the company behind Claude and Claude Code, announced on November 10, 2026 that it has launched the roadshow for its proposed initial public offering. It plans to offer 825 million Class A shares (about 801 million from the company and about 24 million from existing stockholders) at an expected $70 to $78 per share, and has applied to list on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol ANT. The SEC registration statement is filed but not yet effective, so no shares can be sold yet.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A listing would put Anthropic under public-company reporting, which means regular disclosures about revenue, spending and risks behind the Claude products many teams now depend on. Nothing changes in the apps or API today.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude and Claude Code users, teams that buy Claude for work, and anyone following the business side of the AI labs.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to: Anthropic, PBC. Roadshow launched November 10, 2026; expected price range $70.00 to $78.00 per share; proposed Nasdaq symbol ANT; registration statement filed with the SEC but not yet effective. This is industry news, not investment advice. Checked on anthropic.com on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/roadshow-launch" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on www.anthropic.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/anthropic-ipo-roadshow-nasdaq-ant-70-78/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
