    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/zed-pro-free-for-students-one-year-10-ai-credits/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Students get Zed Pro free for a year, with $10 a month in AI credits and unlimited edit predictions</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Zed, the fast collaborative code editor, gives verified university students its Pro plan free for one year. That includes every Pro feature, $10 a month in token credits for the built-in AI assistant, unlimited edit predictions and real-time multiplayer editing with shared terminals and voice chat. You verify with a GitHub account older than 30 days plus a current university email, and after 12 months the account drops back to the Free plan on its own.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a no-cost way for students to use an AI-assisted editor for a whole school year, with collaboration built in for group projects, and no surprise bill when it ends.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">University students (18+) who code for classes, group projects or hackathons.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: students currently enrolled at an accredited university anywhere in the world, aged 18 or over, with a GitHub account older than 30 days and a valid university email. Amount: Zed Pro free for 12 months, including $10/month in AI token credits; the student plan excludes Claude Fable, Claude Opus and GPT Pro models. Deadline: none stated. Afterwards: automatic downgrade to Zed Free; you can upgrade to Pro at any time. Checked on zed.dev/education on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://zed.dev/education" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Zed on zed.dev ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/zed-pro-free-for-students-one-year-10-ai-credits/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
