                                <article id="robotics-2-5-apollo-humanoid-mercedes-96-percent" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-10" class="text-slate-400">Nov 10, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/robotics-2-5-apollo-humanoid-mercedes-96-percent/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A humanoid robot sorted car parts on real Mercedes-Benz lines with 96% success, running Google&#039;s Gemini Robotics 2.5</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google DeepMind released Gemini Robotics 2.5, its model for controlling robot hands and arms. In a proof of concept on active Mercedes-Benz production lines in Hungary and Germany, Apptronik&#039;s Apollo 2 humanoid used it to pick metal brackets from bins and place them into trays in the order each car needs, with a 96% success rate. Across 200 lab tasks such as serving food with tongs, tying a bow and pipetting liquid, DeepMind reports 30% to 100% higher success and 20% to 30% faster completion than its previous models.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s one of the clearest signs yet of general-purpose robot AI doing paid factory work, not just demos. DeepMind&#039;s own team says closing the last 4% gap will be hard, which is a useful reality check.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Anyone following robotics and physical AI, manufacturing teams, and builders working with robot partners.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to: DeepMind&#039;s robotics partners (rolling out to them now). It&#039;s not a public product or API, and per Ars Technica the model still runs in the cloud, not on the robot. Results are DeepMind&#039;s own.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Google DeepMind on deepmind.google ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/gemini/robotics-2-5-apollo-humanoid-mercedes-96-percent/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20humanoid%20robot%20sorted%20car%20parts%20on%20real%20Mercedes-Benz%20lines%20with%2096%25%20success%2C%20running%20Google%27s%20Gemini%20Robotics%202.5&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgemini%2Frobotics-2-5-apollo-humanoid-mercedes-96-percent%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
