                                <article id="ai-studio-google-maps-free-demo-key-no-card" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/ai-studio-google-maps-free-demo-key-no-card/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Build a Google Maps app just by describing it: AI Studio now hands you a free Maps key, no card needed</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google AI Studio&#039;s Build mode now sets up Google Maps Platform for you. Describe a location app, like a trip planner or a store finder, and AI Studio spots the map intent, provisions a Maps Demo Key behind the scenes and stores it in your app&#039;s secrets, so Gemini&#039;s generated code shows a live map straight away. The demo key covers almost every Maps API, including Places, Routes, Geocoding, Street View, weather and air quality, with no credit card or Google Cloud billing account.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Getting an API key and billing set up used to be the slowest part of any map prototype. Now a non-developer can go from an idea to a working, shareable map app in one sitting.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders, students, marketers and developers who want to prototype a location-aware app (trip planner, delivery zone map, store locator) without setting up Google Cloud billing.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free in Google AI Studio Build mode. The Maps Demo Key needs no credit card or billing account and allows 100 requests per API per day, resetting daily; it is for prototyping, not production. Route Optimization, Solar and Nav Connect aren&#039;t included. If you already have a Google Cloud billing account, you use the standard Maps free tier instead. Announced by Google AI Studio on X on November 9, 2026; checked on developers.google.com on November 9, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/ai/ai-studio" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Google for Developers on developers.google.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/gemini/ai-studio-google-maps-free-demo-key-no-card/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Build%20a%20Google%20Maps%20app%20just%20by%20describing%20it%3A%20AI%20Studio%20now%20hands%20you%20a%20free%20Maps%20key%2C%20no%20card%20needed&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgemini%2Fai-studio-google-maps-free-demo-key-no-card%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
