        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-elon-musk-overnight-fixes-reply-with-issues/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Elon Musk promises a &quot;dramatic improvement&quot; to Grok Bot overnight, and asks users to reply with whatever is still broken</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">After users complained about Grok Bot burning through its allowance and getting less sharp, Elon Musk posted on November 8 that fixes for better token efficiency and smarter behavior were underway. Early on November 9 he followed up after a round-table review with the Grok Bot engineering team: fixes were being implemented overnight, users should notice a dramatic improvement by the next day, and anyone who didn&#039;t could reply to his post so the team could address remaining issues right away. The post drew more than 7,000 replies.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If your Bots were running out of allowance fast or forgetting context, this is the moment to re-test them and report what&#039;s still wrong while the team is actively collecting feedback.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot users on The X Subscription, SuperGrok or eligible Cursor plans who hit quota or quality problems in the past week.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to all Grok Bot users. Musk&#039;s posts don&#039;t list specific changes or a changelog, so judge the improvement on your own tasks. Posted November 8 and 9, 2026; checked on X on November 9, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2119617455102333206" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @elonmusk on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-elon-musk-overnight-fixes-reply-with-issues/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
