        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-roemmele-youtube-podcasts-weekly-magazine-epub/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Turn your YouTube and podcast backlog into a Sunday magazine: Brian Roemmele&#039;s shareable Grok Bot makes a Kindle EPUB every week</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Brian Roemmele shared a Grok Bot, &quot;Any Video Into A Magazine&quot;, that follows the YouTube channels and podcasts you choose and, once a week, rewrites each new episode as a magazine-style feature. He says each issue includes real frames from the videos with captions, word-for-word pull quotes, a finished EPUB for your Kindle and a newsletter in your inbox, with every story crediting and linking back to the creator. His pitch: a three-hour podcast becomes a ten-minute read. Elon Musk reposted it.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Most people&#039;s &#039;watch later&#039; list never gets watched. A weekly digest you can actually read is a practical, low-risk first job for an always-on agent.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Busy people with a pile of saved videos and podcasts, Kindle readers, and newsletter writers who follow a set of shows.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Shared as a Grok Bot template on x.ai on November 9, 2026. Needs Grok Bot (The X Subscription Premium or higher for new customers, or an eligible SuperGrok or Cursor plan) and uses your Bot allowance. Keep the issues for personal reading and link back to creators, as the Bot does.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/2119815091092861330" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @BrianRoemmele on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-roemmele-youtube-podcasts-weekly-magazine-epub/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Turn%20your%20YouTube%20and%20podcast%20backlog%20into%20a%20Sunday%20magazine%3A%20Brian%20Roemmele%27s%20shareable%20Grok%20Bot%20makes%20a%20Kindle%20EPUB%20every%20week&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-roemmele-youtube-podcasts-weekly-magazine-epub%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
