        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/fable-5-2-free-week-pro-plus-tenure-resets/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Pro gets Fable 5.2 free for a week (until Nov 16), and long-time Max subscribers get up to 3 free resets</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">To launch Fable 5.2, Anthropic is handing out extra Fable usage. Pro plans and standard Team seats, which normally pay for Fable with usage credits, get every Fable model included in their plan until November 16, up to 50% of their weekly limit, plus one free Fable limit reset. Max, Ultra and premium Team seats get one to three free resets depending on how long they&#039;ve paid: under six months gets one, six to twelve months two, and over a year three. A reset gives back the weekly usage you spent on Fable and refills your five-hour window.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a free, no-risk window to test Anthropic&#039;s strongest public model on real work, and the resets are a rare loyalty perk: the longer you&#039;ve paid, the more you get back.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Pro, Max, Ultra and Team subscribers who want to try Fable 5.2 on a big task without blowing their week&#039;s limits.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free for eligible paid accounts with billing in place before November 9, 2026 at 10:00 am PT. Pro and standard Team seats: Fable included up to 50% of weekly limits through November 16, 2026, 11:59 pm PT, plus one reset that expires then. Max, Ultra, premium Team and premium legacy Enterprise seats: one to three resets by tenure, expiring March 8, 2027, 11:59 pm PT. Not on Free, self-serve or usage-based Enterprise, standard legacy Enterprise seats or HIPAA-ready Enterprise. After the week, Pro goes back to paying for Fable with usage credits. Checked on support.claude.com on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://support.claude.com/en/articles/17506494-claude-fable-5-2-launch-offers" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Claude Help Center on support.claude.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/fable-5-2-free-week-pro-plus-tenure-resets/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
