    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/cursor/fable-5-2-tops-cursorbench-60-percent/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Fable 5.2 lands in Cursor and takes the top spot on CursorBench at 60%</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cursor added Claude Fable 5.2 to its model list the same day Anthropic shipped it. On CursorBench, Cursor&#039;s own test of real coding tasks, Fable 5.2 scores 60% at max effort, the highest of any model Cursor has tested, and 56.9% at default effort, up from 49.2% for Fable 5.1. That makes it the strongest option in Cursor&#039;s picker for hard, multi-file agent work, though it&#039;s also one of the priciest per token.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> CursorBench measures the kind of work people actually do in Cursor, so a 7.7-point jump at default effort is a practical signal of fewer failed agent runs on tough tasks.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Cursor users who hit walls with their usual model on big refactors, gnarly bugs or long agent runs.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Available in Cursor&#039;s model picker from November 9, 2026, per Cursor&#039;s official post. Usage is billed under your Cursor plan&#039;s model pricing; Anthropic&#039;s API list price for Fable 5.2 is $8/$40 per million input/output tokens. Checked on X on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2119880829212172509" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @cursor_ai on X ↗</a>
