                                <article id="nuance-labs-emma-ai-face-reacts-while-you-talk-free" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/nuance-labs-emma-ai-face-reacts-while-you-talk-free/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Video-call an AI that nods and smiles while you&#039;re still talking: Emma is free to try, no account</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Seattle startup Nuance Labs launched Emma, an AI video persona built on its Nuplex model, which listens and speaks at the same time. Instead of waiting for you to finish, Emma nods, smiles and shifts her gaze as you talk, and Nuance says its reply timing overlaps a real person&#039;s 89% of the time on 1,785 test questions, versus 35% for the next closest system. Her face and voice are licensed from a real actress, she always says she&#039;s an AI, and developers can build with the Nuplex Beta API.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a free way to feel how much more natural face-to-face AI conversation is getting, and a useful option for things like practicing interviews.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Anyone curious about real-time AI video, people practicing interviews or presentations, and developers exploring talking-avatar APIs.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: adults 18+ in the US (except Colorado, Connecticut, Illinois and Texas), the EU, the UK and Canada (except Quebec). Amount: free to talk to Emma in the browser, no account needed. Deadline: none stated. Afterwards: the Nuplex Beta API is separate at platform.nuancelabs.ai. English only. Checked on nuancelabs.ai on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://home.nuancelabs.ai/research/meet-emma-the-first-nuplex-persona" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Nuance Labs on home.nuancelabs.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/nuance-labs-emma-ai-face-reacts-while-you-talk-free/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Video-call%20an%20AI%20that%20nods%20and%20smiles%20while%20you%27re%20still%20talking%3A%20Emma%20is%20free%20to%20try%2C%20no%20account&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fnuance-labs-emma-ai-face-reacts-while-you-talk-free%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
