                                <article id="zyphra-zonos3-mini-free-voice-cloning-runs-in-browser" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/zyphra-zonos3-mini-free-voice-cloning-runs-in-browser/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free voice cloning that runs on your phone&#039;s browser: Zyphra open-sourced ZONOS3-Mini</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Zyphra released ZONOS3-Mini, a small text-to-speech model that clones a voice from a short sample and runs in real time on your own device. It has 100 million active parameters (800 million total), and Zyphra reports under 570 ms to first audio in the browser on a Pixel 9 and under 150 ms on an M3 MacBook Air. You can steer accent, age, pace, emotion, loudness and even whisper on chosen words, and the weights are free under Apache 2.0 on Hugging Face, with browser (WebGPU), GGML and server runtimes.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Natural-sounding, controllable voices for an app, game or agent no longer need a paid API or a big GPU. You can run it locally so audio never leaves your machine.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers adding voices to apps, agents or games, and creators who want local text-to-speech.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone. Amount: free open weights (Apache 2.0, commercial use allowed) on huggingface.co/Zyphra/ZONOS3-Mini; Zyphra&#039;s hosted inference is a separate service. Deadline: none. Checked on zyphra.com on November 10, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.zyphra.com/our-work/zonos3-mini" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Zyphra on www.zyphra.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/zyphra-zonos3-mini-free-voice-cloning-runs-in-browser/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Free%20voice%20cloning%20that%20runs%20on%20your%20phone%27s%20browser%3A%20Zyphra%20open-sourced%20ZONOS3-Mini&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fzyphra-zonos3-mini-free-voice-cloning-runs-in-browser%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
