                                <article id="crosby-law-firm-5-million-insurance-for-ai-agents-drops-lawyer-review" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-09" class="text-slate-400">Nov 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/crosby-law-firm-5-million-insurance-for-ai-agents-drops-lawyer-review/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A law firm got its AI agents a $5 million insurance policy, then stopped having lawyers check 20% of their work</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Crosby, a law firm that pairs lawyers with AI agents, says it has bought a $5 million liability policy that covers its agents&#039; work, from Testudo, which is backed by Lloyd&#039;s of London. Testudo reviewed Crosby&#039;s systems, models, controls and human-review logs before agreeing. When the policy took effect in early November, Crosby removed lawyer oversight from tasks that don&#039;t legally need a lawyer, about 20% of what its lawyers used to do, and expects agents to outnumber attorneys 15 to 1 by year-end.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Insurance is how businesses price risk, so an insurer covering an agent&#039;s mistakes is a big step toward agents doing work without a human checking every output.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Legal and compliance teams, founders deploying agents for client work, and anyone tracking how companies hand real responsibility to AI.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to: Crosby&#039;s own practice; Crosby calls it the first liability policy for a law firm&#039;s agents. Lawyers still handle work that legally requires them. Crosby doesn&#039;t name the models it uses.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://crosby.ai/blog/ai-agent-insurance" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Crosby on crosby.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/crosby-law-firm-5-million-insurance-for-ai-agents-drops-lawyer-review/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20law%20firm%20got%20its%20AI%20agents%20a%20%245%20million%20insurance%20policy%2C%20then%20stopped%20having%20lawyers%20check%2020%25%20of%20their%20work&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcrosby-law-firm-5-million-insurance-for-ai-agents-drops-lawyer-review%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
