                                <article id="antigravity-deepmind-chemists-patents-to-candidate-molecules-in-an-hour" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="research">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Research</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-08" class="text-slate-400">Nov 8, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/antigravity-deepmind-chemists-patents-to-candidate-molecules-in-an-hour/" class="hover:text-brand-600">From patents to new candidate molecules in an hour: what Google DeepMind&#039;s chemists had Antigravity&#039;s agent do</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google&#039;s Antigravity team shared a demo of Google DeepMind chemists using the Antigravity agent to pull compound data out of patents and papers, work out what drives potency, and propose new candidate molecules along with synthesis routes, all in about an hour. The agent also built an interactive viewer so the chemists could browse the retrieved molecules together, inspect their properties and plot how structure relates to potency.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Literature mining and structure-activity tables eat days of a scientist&#039;s week. This shows a general coding agent doing that groundwork and handing back a tool the team can explore, not just a chat answer.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Chemists, biotech and materials researchers, and research engineers who spend hours pulling data out of papers and patents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Antigravity is Google&#039;s agent-first coding app, with a free plan that has a weekly agent quota and paid tiers (see antigravity.google/pricing). The demo is Google&#039;s own showcase from November 8, 2026; proposed molecules are hypotheses that still need expert review and lab validation.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/antigravity/status/2119490135049867264" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @antigravity on X ↗</a>
