    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-pro-50-tier-poll-4400-replies/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Would you pay $50 for Codex? OpenAI&#039;s Codex lead floated a &quot;Pro 50&quot; plan and got more than 4,400 replies</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Tibo, who leads Codex at OpenAI, first cleared up confusion about ChatGPT&#039;s Pro tiers: none of them have five-hour limits, and compared with Plus they give 10x usage on Pro 100, 20x on Pro 200 and 50x on Pro 500, which also gets ultrafast access. About half an hour later he asked whether a &quot;Pro 50&quot; would make sense. The question passed 1.7 million views and more than 4,400 replies, many from people who find the jump from the $20 Plus plan to $100 too steep.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A middle tier would change the math for anyone who outgrows Plus on Codex but can&#039;t justify $100 a month. It&#039;s only a question for now, so don&#039;t plan around it yet.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">ChatGPT Plus users who keep hitting Codex limits, and anyone comparing Codex with Claude Code or Cursor plans.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Pro 50 is not a real plan; Tibo only asked whether it would make sense, on November 8, 2026. Current tiers: Pro 100 ($100/month, 10x Plus), Pro 200 ($200, 20x) and Pro 500 ($500, 50x plus ultrafast), all without five-hour limits, per his post. Checked on X on November 9, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2119305294291612140" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @thsottiaux on X ↗</a>
