    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/1-000-free-web-search-credits-a-month-for-your-agents-tavily/" class="hover:text-brand-600">1,000 free web-search credits a month for your agents: Tavily Researcher, no card</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Tavily&#039;s Researcher plan is a standing free tier for agent search: 1,000 API credits every month, no credit card required, with email support. Credits reset on the first day of each month. You sign up, grab an API key from the dashboard, and call search, extract or crawl endpoints from Claude Code, Cursor, custom agents or Tavily&#039;s SDKs. Advanced or higher-volume requests spend more credits per call; when the monthly pool is gone, requests stop until reset or you move to Pay As You Go ($0.008 listed) or a Project plan. Students can request a separate free arrangement, and startups can apply for 100k credits.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Agents that cannot search go stale. A monthly free search pool is enough to prototype retrieval tools without wiring a paid SERP key on day one.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Builders wiring web search into Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT tools or custom agents who want a no-card starting allowance.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone who creates a Tavily account. Amount: 1,000 API credits per month on Researcher; no credit card. Deadline: none (standing free plan); credits reset on the 1st of each month. Afterwards: Pay As You Go or Project from $30. Checked on tavily.com/pricing on November 7, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
