                                <article id="code-cloud-sessions-set-up-your-repo-themselves" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="coding">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Coding</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-07" class="text-slate-400">Nov 7, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-cloud-sessions-set-up-your-repo-themselves/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Code cloud sessions now set up your repo themselves, and never see your API keys</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic made it easier to get a repo running in Claude Code cloud sessions. Instead of you writing a setup script by hand, Claude works out which dependencies, network access and API keys the project needs, then saves that environment so the next session starts ready. API keys are stored as network secrets: Anthropic&#039;s proxy attaches them to requests for hosts you allow after traffic leaves the VM, so Claude and the session files never see the key itself. The same environment applies whether you start from the desktop app, mobile, claude.ai/code or claude --cloud.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> The slowest part of a cloud agent run is often getting the repo to build at all. A saved, auto-detected environment means the second task starts working right away, and secrets stay out of the model&#039;s context.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Pro, Max and Ultra users who hand coding tasks to cloud sessions, especially on repos with private packages or third-party APIs.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Announced by @ClaudeDevs on November 6, 2026 for Pro, Max and Ultra. Anthropic&#039;s cloud environments docs also list Team plans and Enterprise premium or Chat + Claude Code seats for cloud sessions. Checked on code.claude.com/docs/en/cloud-environments on November 7, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2118795192090386454" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @ClaudeDevs on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-cloud-sessions-set-up-your-repo-themselves/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Claude%20Code%20cloud%20sessions%20now%20set%20up%20your%20repo%20themselves%2C%20and%20never%20see%20your%20API%20keys&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcode-cloud-sessions-set-up-your-repo-themselves%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
