    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/antigravity-weekend-quota-reset-everyone/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free weekend refill: Google reset everyone&#039;s Antigravity quota for Gemini and Argon</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Varun Mohan, who leads Google Antigravity, posted on November 6 that Google was resetting everyone&#039;s Gemini and Argon quota in Antigravity so people can build over the weekend after a week of updates (remote agents, voice mode and a redesigned app). The reset applies to your existing allowance automatically; there is nothing to claim. It&#039;s a one-off refill rather than a new plan, so normal limits and reset timing return afterwards.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you hit your Antigravity limit midweek, you have a fresh allowance right now to try remote agents or voice mode without waiting for the regular reset.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Anyone using Google Antigravity, including Free-plan users, who ran low on agent quota this week.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: all Antigravity users, per Varun Mohan&#039;s post (Nov 6, 2026, 11:57 PM UTC). Amount: your current Gemini and Argon quota reset to full. Deadline: one-off reset; normal limits apply afterwards. Cost: free. Remote Agents still need Google AI Pro or Ultra.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/_mohansolo/status/2118855362518675720" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @_mohansolo on X ↗</a>
