                                <article id="vork-headless-3d-engine-agents-write-shots-as-code" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="video">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Video</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-07" class="text-slate-400">Nov 7, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/vork-headless-3d-engine-agents-write-shots-as-code/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A million birds in 97 seconds: vork is a free 3D engine your coding agent drives in code</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">vork, from Voyager, is a headless 3D and VFX engine built for agents rather than people. There&#039;s no editor: the agent writes a scene as JSON or code, renders a preview, looks at the image and revises. Materials, cameras, light, simulation and compositing are small programs, so an agent can bend light around a black hole or write its own flocking sim. Voyager&#039;s demo shows a million self-steering birds simulated and rendered in 97 seconds on one NVIDIA L4, with setup time listed separately. It&#039;s written in Rust and Slang and renders through Vulkan or Metal.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Agents are good at writing code but bad at clicking through Blender. An engine whose whole interface is code and a ~2,500-token help page lets Codex, Claude Code or Cursor make real rendered shots, not AI video.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers and motion designers who want agents to produce product shots, VFX tests or simulations on their own GPU.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Research preview 0.1, source-available and free during the preview. Runs on Windows or Linux with a recent NVIDIA GPU, or Apple Silicon (bundled toolchain targets macOS 26). Optional Voyager cloud GPUs need a paid workspace. Fog and volumes aren&#039;t supported yet. Checked on voyager.so/vork on November 7, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://voyager.so/vork" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Voyager on voyager.so ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/vork-headless-3d-engine-agents-write-shots-as-code/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20million%20birds%20in%2097%20seconds%3A%20vork%20is%20a%20free%203D%20engine%20your%20coding%20agent%20drives%20in%20code&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fvork-headless-3d-engine-agents-write-shots-as-code%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
