    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/qoder-qoduck-stealth-model-free-daily/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Alibaba&#039;s Qoder dropped a mystery coding model, Qoduck, and it&#039;s free every day for now</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Qoder, the agentic coding app from Alibaba&#039;s Qwen side of the business, added an unannounced model called Qoduck and won&#039;t say where it came from. Qoder&#039;s official account says it&#039;s free every day for all individual users for a limited time, so you can point Qoder&#039;s agents at real tasks without spending your credits. Early testers on X are guessing it&#039;s an unreleased Qwen model, but Qoder hasn&#039;t confirmed anything. Qoder warns that demand is high at peak times, so you may wait a moment for responses.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A free, strong coding model is a cheap way to offload routine agent work and compare it with the model you pay for. Mystery models like this also tend to hint at what a lab ships next.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Individual developers who want a free coding agent model to test this weekend, and anyone benchmarking new models.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free daily for all individual Qoder users, for a limited time; Qoder hasn&#039;t published an end date or a daily cap. Team and Enterprise terms not stated. After the promo, Qoder uses credits under its normal plans, and new users get a 2-week Pro trial. Announced by @qoder_ai_ide on November 7, 2026; checked on Qoder&#039;s official X account on November 7, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/qoder_ai_ide/status/2118889023339208755" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @qoder_ai_ide on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/qoder-qoduck-stealth-model-free-daily/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
