            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders, marketers and solo builders who want an AI app or site builder without entering a card.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone who signs up at bolt.new; no credit card. Amount: 1M tokens per month, 300K daily limit, hosting and unlimited databases included; Free tokens do not roll over. Deadline: none stated (standing Free plan). Afterwards: Pro from $25/month, Teams from $30/member/month. Checked on bolt.new/pricing on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
