    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cognition&#039;s Devin desktop editor now has a standing Free plan at $0. Official pricing says it includes a light quota to code with agents, limited model availability, unlimited inline edits and unlimited Tab completions. Paid Pro at $20 a month unlocks frontier models (including Claude, OpenAI, Gemini and SpaceXAI), free use of Cognition&#039;s SWE-2 model and Devin Cloud agents; Max is $200 a month for much higher quotas. Free is meant as a try-before-you-buy path into the same editor teams use on paid seats.</p>
