    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google Antigravity&#039;s Free plan lets anyone with a Google account try the agent IDE without paying. Official pricing lists access to a variety of agent models, unlimited Tab completions, unlimited Command requests and basic weekly rate limits. Remote Agents (cloud VMs that keep coding after you close the laptop) stay on Google AI Pro and Ultra only, so Free is for local agent work and Tab. Paid consumer plans add higher rate limits and a flexible AI credit pool.</p>
