            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers who want to try Antigravity without a Google AI subscription, and who do not need cloud Remote Agents yet.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone with a Google account (Free plan users not on Google AI Pro or Ultra). Amount: Free plan with basic weekly agent rate limits, unlimited Tab and unlimited Command; Remote Agents excluded. Deadline: none stated. Afterwards: Google AI Pro / Ultra for higher limits and Remote Agents; Business via Google Cloud. Checked on antigravity.google/pricing and Remote Agents docs on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
