        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-06" class="text-slate-400">Nov 6, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/heptabase-whiteboard-inside-claude-desktop/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude can now open your Heptabase whiteboard inside the chat and edit it live</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Heptabase&#039;s official Claude plugin lets Claude search cards, journals, PDFs and whiteboards, then open a whiteboard inside the Claude chat so you can browse and edit while Claude&#039;s changes appear live. The same in-chat whiteboard works in Claude Code when you run it inside the Claude desktop app with the plugin connected. Terminal or IDE Claude Code can still create and arrange boards through MCP, but it cannot embed the whiteboard UI; keep the Heptabase app open for those sessions. Plugins installed in Claude sync to Claude Code on the same account.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Research notes stop living in a separate app you forget to open. Claude can rearrange the map while you watch.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Researchers, PMs and writers who keep projects in Heptabase and already use Claude or Claude Code.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Official Heptabase plugin for Claude (web and desktop) and Claude Code. In-chat whiteboard UI needs Claude, or Claude Code inside the Claude desktop app. Team/Enterprise workspaces may need the owner to enable plugins. Checked on Heptabase Help Center on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://support.heptabase.com/en/articles/17574823-use-heptabase-with-claude-and-claude-code" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Heptabase on support.heptabase.com ↗</a>
