    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/marketplace-14-partner-agents-november-4/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Marketplace just added 14 partner agents for security, creatives and ops</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">On November 4, 2026 Anthropic added a wave of partner agents and products to Claude Marketplace, bringing the catalog past 25 listings. New security names include Chainguard Harness, Checkmarx One, Cyera Agent Guardian, Rubrik Code Guardian and Tanium Cloud. Developer infra adds Datadog Agent Observability and Netlify Enterprise. Creative and marketing get AirOps, Runway and Webflow; productivity gets Asana AI Teammates, Glean, monday agents and Zoom Agentic Search. Eligible enterprise customers can apply part of their committed Anthropic spend toward these purchases.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Enterprise teams can buy security, deploy and ops agents next to Claude on one commitment instead of signing a dozen separate pilots.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Enterprise buyers and security, platform and marketing leads evaluating partner agents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to Claude Marketplace listings; purchase requests go through each partner page. Eligible enterprise customers may apply committed Anthropic spend. Checked on Anthropic&#039;s Marketplace article on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
