        <a href="https://claude.com/resources/articles/new-agents-and-products-claude-marketplace" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on claude.com ↗</a>
