                                <article id="enterprise-security-center-inference-hooks-ga" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-06" class="text-slate-400">Nov 6, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/enterprise-security-center-inference-hooks-ga/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Enterprise gets a security center, and inference hooks are now generally available</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic&#039;s November 5, 2026 Enterprise update gives security teams a Security Center that compares chat, Cowork and Claude Code settings with Anthropic&#039;s recommended configuration, plus downloadable review reports. Inference hooks are generally available: prompt hooks and pre-tool-call hooks send traffic to your DLP or security tools for an allow/deny before Claude continues. The same drop adds a parent admin console at admin.claude.com, Admin API member sign-out, self-serve IP allowlists, Claude Desktop controls that can block personal accounts on managed machines, and a beta EDR sensor inside the local Cowork virtual machine.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Security teams finally get the same policy hooks and posture view for Claude that they already expect for SaaS and endpoints.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Enterprise security, IT and compliance admins who need DLP hooks, posture reports and centralized identity.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Enterprise. Security Center, centralized management, Admin API sign-out and self-serve IP allowlist are in beta; inference hooks are generally available; EDR-in-VM is beta on macOS and Windows for Team and Enterprise (and some cloud desktop deployments). Checked on Anthropic&#039;s Enterprise security article on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-enterprise-security-updates" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on claude.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/enterprise-security-center-inference-hooks-ga/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Claude%20Enterprise%20gets%20a%20security%20center%2C%20and%20inference%20hooks%20are%20now%20generally%20available&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fenterprise-security-center-inference-hooks-ga%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
