                                <article id="duet-runs-claude-code-sessions-from-phone-3-free-resets" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-06" class="text-slate-400">Nov 6, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/duet-runs-claude-code-sessions-from-phone-3-free-resets/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Run Claude Code from your phone: Claude Duet now steers your sessions, and Pro users get 3 free limit resets</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Claude Duet, Anthropic&#039;s message-it-like-a-person agent, can now see and steer your Claude Code sessions. From your phone you can check what a session is doing, approve changes and send follow-up instructions, whether the session runs on your own computer or in Anthropic&#039;s cloud. Duet also works with your Claude Projects now and picks up your existing chats and memory. Anthropic&#039;s help center adds a sweetener for the research preview: Pro accounts get three full limit resets and Max or Ultra accounts get one, each refilling both the five-hour and weekly limits.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Long Claude Code runs often stall waiting for one approval while you&#039;re away from the desk. Approving from your phone keeps them moving, and the bonus resets give you room to try it without burning your week.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">US Claude Pro, Max and Ultra users who run long Claude Code sessions and want to unblock them away from their computer.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Research preview for Pro, Max and Ultra plans in the US, via waitlist; not on Team or Enterprise yet. Included at no extra cost but uses your plan limits. Limit resets: Pro 3, Max and Ultra 1, used from Settings &gt; Usage; unused resets expire December 15, 2026. Announced by Duet lead David Sutton on November 6, 2026; checked on support.claude.com on November 7, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/davidsuttonca/status/2118785613436698719" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @davidsuttonca on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/duet-runs-claude-code-sessions-from-phone-3-free-resets/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
