    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/fish-audio-s2-1-pro-free-until-november-30/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Fish Audio&#039;s top voice model is $0 until November 30, voice cloning and 83 languages included</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Fish Audio lets developers call its flagship text-to-speech model, S2.1 Pro, for free through November 30, 2026 by using the model string s2.1-pro-free. It&#039;s the same model as the paid s2.1-pro, with 83 languages, voice cloning and bracket-style emotion and delivery tags, on the same API endpoint. There&#039;s no hard character cap, only a fair-use policy. The trade-offs: no uptime or latency guarantee, and free requests may be used to improve Fish Audio&#039;s models. Claude Code or any other coding agent can wire it into a project with one API call.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Natural-sounding voice is often the priciest part of a voice agent or narrated video. Nearly four weeks of the full model for free is enough to build and test a real prototype.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers prototyping voice agents, narration, dubbing or read-aloud features, plus small businesses testing TTS.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free for anyone with a Fish Audio API key through November 30, 2026, with no card required, under a fair-use policy. Fish Audio says it&#039;s for testing, prototyping, development and smaller businesses, and products making over $1M a year should contact Fish Audio first. Afterwards, paid S2.1 Pro is $15 per million characters. Checked on Fish Audio&#039;s blog, developer page and docs changelog on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://fish.audio/blog/s2-1-pro-free-api/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Fish Audio on fish.audio ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/fish-audio-s2-1-pro-free-until-november-30/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Fish%20Audio%27s%20top%20voice%20model%20is%20%240%20until%20November%2030%2C%20voice%20cloning%20and%2083%20languages%20included&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Ffish-audio-s2-1-pro-free-until-november-30%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Add text-to-speech to [your project] with Fish Audio&#039;s TTS API. Use the model s2.1-pro-free (not s2.1-pro, which bills), read the API key from an environment variable, and retry on slow responses. Put a TODO to switch models before November 30, 2026." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
