            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers comparing coding models, teams looking for a cheaper long-context model, and anyone curious about Tencent&#039;s agents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free in CodeBuddy and WorkBuddy from November 4 to November 15, 2026, subject to daily quotas. The Hy4 API on Tencent Cloud TokenHub is 50% off through December 31, 2026. On OpenRouter it&#039;s paid at the listed per-token price, about $0.90 per million input tokens and $2.70 per million output tokens at the time of checking. Tencent says open weights are coming in the coming days. Checked on Tencent&#039;s announcement and OpenRouter on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
