    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">StepFun is letting developers use its StepAudio 3 preview models for free on its API until 23:59:59 on November 8, 2026 (UTC+8), which is 8:59 PM PKT. The preview lineup covers realtime voice conversation (stepaudio-3-realtime-preview), audio chat (stepaudio-3-chat-preview), speech and voice generation including cloning and voice design (stepaudio-3-gen-preview), and music (stepaudio-3-music-preview). Paid pricing starts November 9, and the preview model IDs are retired after the trial. Claude Code or any coding agent can wire them into a prototype quickly.</p>
