                                <article id="meta-buys-conductor-export-cloud-workspaces-by-november-20" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="muse" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/muse/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/15 dark:text-violet-300">Muse</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/muse/meta-buys-conductor-export-cloud-workspaces-by-november-20/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Meta bought Conductor, the app for running coding agents side by side. Cloud users have until November 20 to move their work</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Conductor, a Mac app that runs several coding agents in parallel, each in its own workspace, is joining Meta. CEO Charlie Holtz says the team will work at Meta Superintelligence Labs with Nat Friedman and Alexandr Wang on &#039;the next interface&#039;, and Wang welcomed them with &#039;muse gang growing&#039;. New sign-ups and downloads stopped on November 4, and existing Pro users keep Pro features for free. Conductor Cloud goes read-only on November 13 and shuts down on November 20, when user data starts being deleted. Local Conductor keeps getting new models and critical fixes until early 2027.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you run your agents in Conductor Cloud, you have a hard deadline to move your work. For everyone else, it&#039;s another sign that big labs want to own the interface for managing many agents at once.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Conductor users, especially Conductor Cloud users, and developers watching Meta&#039;s Muse and agent plans.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">No new sign-ups since November 4, 2026. Pro features are free for existing Pro users, and active subscribers get refunds. Conductor Cloud becomes read-only on November 13 and shuts down on November 20, 2026. The local app keeps working until early 2027. Checked on Conductor&#039;s announcement and its X posts on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.conductor.build/announcement" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Conductor on www.conductor.build ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/muse/meta-buys-conductor-export-cloud-workspaces-by-november-20/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Meta%20bought%20Conductor%2C%20the%20app%20for%20running%20coding%20agents%20side%20by%20side.%20Cloud%20users%20have%20until%20November%2020%20to%20move%20their%20work&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fmuse%2Fmeta-buys-conductor-export-cloud-workspaces-by-november-20%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
