                                <article id="bot-phone-calls-dentist-insurance-check" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="productivity">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-phone-calls-dentist-insurance-check/" class="hover:text-brand-600">&quot;Grok Bot is calling my dentist to see if they take my insurance&quot;: phone calls are now officially part of Grok Bot</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">The official Grok Bot account announced on November 4, 2026 that Grok Bot can now make phone calls. You tell your Bot who to call and why, and it dials, gets through the phone menu, waits on hold and talks to the person, while you watch a live transcript. If the other side asks for something like a PIN, it asks you in the chat and passes on your answer, and you get a summary afterwards. Hours later Arthur MacWaters posted that his Bot was calling a dentist to see if they take his insurance, and Elon Musk shared it: &#039;Grok @Bot can call your dentist on the phone!&#039;</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Small calls like checking insurance, booking appointments or asking about a bill eat time because of hold music and phone menus. Handing them off while you read the transcript later gives that time back.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Busy people who put off routine calls to doctors, dentists, utilities and service providers.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Announced by Grok Bot on November 4, 2026. Users report it calls US numbers and asks you to accept a calling card once before the first call. Calls say they&#039;re made by a virtual assistant and may be recorded, and they can&#039;t be used for marketing, mass calls or emergency services. Some companies won&#039;t act on an account over an AI call. Checked on Grok Bot&#039;s X post on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/bot/status/2118043939592942052" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @bot on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-phone-calls-dentist-insurance-check/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=%22Grok%20Bot%20is%20calling%20my%20dentist%20to%20see%20if%20they%20take%20my%20insurance%22%3A%20phone%20calls%20are%20now%20officially%20part%20of%20Grok%20Bot&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-phone-calls-dentist-insurance-check%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Call [business name] at [phone number] and ask whether they accept [insurance plan] for [type of visit]. If they do, ask for the earliest appointment next week. Ask me before sharing any personal details beyond my name." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
</div>
