        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/cat-wu-joins-openai-core-products/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Cat Wu, one of the people behind Claude Code, is joining OpenAI to lead product management for Core Products</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cat Wu, who worked on Claude Code at Anthropic, announced on November 5, 2026 (PKT) that she&#039;s joining OpenAI to lead product management for Core Products. She said she&#039;ll work with Thibault Sottiaux and OpenAI&#039;s PM team to &#039;build agents that have your back and your team&#039;s, and keep you in control&#039;. Sottiaux replied &#039;Welcome Cat&#039;, and the post passed 2.5 million views within a day.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> The people who shaped Claude Code&#039;s product now help steer OpenAI&#039;s core products, so expect the race between Codex and Claude Code to speed up. Users of both are likely to benefit.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers who use Claude Code or Codex and people following the AI talent race.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">This is a career move, not a product launch. No product changes have been announced yet. Checked on Cat Wu&#039;s X post and Thibault Sottiaux&#039;s reply on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/_catwu/status/2118137612577968402" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @_catwu on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/cat-wu-joins-openai-core-products/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
