                                <article id="quixel-megascans-free-on-fab-ai-training-rights" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/quixel-megascans-free-on-fab-ai-training-rights/" class="hover:text-brand-600">The entire Quixel Megascans library is going free on Fab, and you&#039;re now allowed to train AI models on it</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Epic&#039;s Quixel team announced on November 5, 2026 that the full Megascans library, the photoscanned rocks, plants, surfaces and props used in countless games and films, is becoming free on Fab. Listings switch over between now and November 12, so some assets may still show a price for a few days. Quixel also changed the terms for all Quixel assets so you can train AI models on Megascans and Megaplants. Anyone who bought Megascans or a Quixel bundle on or after January 1, 2025 gets a refund to their Epic Account Balance by the end of 2026 and keeps the license plus the new AI rights.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Free, photoreal 3D assets with explicit AI-training rights are rare. Game devs and anyone building scenes with an AI agent get a big, legal asset library at no cost.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Indie game developers, 3D artists, Unreal and Unity users, and teams training image or 3D models on licensed data.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free on Fab for everyone with an Epic account; listings update gradually through November 12, 2026. Studio-license customers stay on their contract terms. Refunds for purchases since January 1, 2025 go to your Epic Account Balance by the end of 2026 after you accept the latest terms. Checked on Quixel&#039;s announcement and Quixel&#039;s X post on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://quixel.com/news/update-megascans-are-going-free-again" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Quixel (Epic Games) on quixel.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/quixel-megascans-free-on-fab-ai-training-rights/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=The%20entire%20Quixel%20Megascans%20library%20is%20going%20free%20on%20Fab%2C%20and%20you%27re%20now%20allowed%20to%20train%20AI%20models%20on%20it&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fquixel-megascans-free-on-fab-ai-training-rights%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
