                                <article id="upsun-dispatch-free-20-agent-minutes-a-day-no-api-key" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-05" class="text-slate-400">Nov 5, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/upsun-dispatch-free-20-agent-minutes-a-day-no-api-key/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free AI code reviews with no API key and no card: Upsun Dispatch now gives every new org 20 agent-minutes a day</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Upsun Dispatch, a platform where AI agents review code and turn issues into code inside isolated sandboxes with human approval gates, now includes AI usage on its Free plan. Starting November 5, 2026, every new organization gets 20 agent-minutes a day in total, one run at a time, with no model API key and no credit card. You connect a GitHub or GitLab repository and the first automated code review runs on the next pull request. The allowance resets after midnight UTC, and Upsun picks the model for you and may change it over time.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a quick way to get an AI reviewer on a side project without setting up keys or billing. The catch is real: Upsun may use your Free-plan code and outputs to train AI models.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Solo developers and small teams who want automated pull-request reviews on non-sensitive repos.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free plan for new Upsun Dispatch organizations: 20 agent-minutes a day, one run at a time, GitHub or GitLab repos. Upsun says it may use content, inputs and outputs from Free usage to train AI models; Pay as you go (billed per second, no seats) doesn&#039;t use your content for training without consent. Checked on Upsun&#039;s blog on November 5, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://upsun.com/blog/free-ai-usage-no-api-key/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Upsun on upsun.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/upsun-dispatch-free-20-agent-minutes-a-day-no-api-key/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Free%20AI%20code%20reviews%20with%20no%20API%20key%20and%20no%20card%3A%20Upsun%20Dispatch%20now%20gives%20every%20new%20org%2020%20agent-minutes%20a%20day&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fupsun-dispatch-free-20-agent-minutes-a-day-no-api-key%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
