            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> You can try an agent on real busywork, like scheduling or a weekly report, without installing anything or entering a card.</p>
