            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders, freelancers and small teams who want to offload admin by email.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: new Viktor users. Amount: up to $100 in credits on the Free plan, no credit card, credits don&#039;t expire. Deadline: none stated. Afterwards: Team plan from $100 a month for 40,000 shared credits (larger tiers available), Enterprise custom. Checked on viktor.com and viktor.com/pricing on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
