    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-turns-style-images-into-music-video/" class="hover:text-brand-600">She handed her Grok Bot a few images she liked. It animated them, filled the gaps, edited a 2-minute video and added music</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">An X user shared a roughly two-minute atmospheric video and explained how her Grok Bot made it. She gave it a handful of images in one shared style and, unsure what to do with them, asked the bot for ideas. After she picked a direction based on her taste, the bot animated the images, generated extra matching images where it thought they were needed, edited the sequence and added a soundtrack. Her tip: ask for a few-second sample first so you don&#039;t burn through your usage, and take the bot&#039;s creative suggestions seriously.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows an agent handling the whole small-video pipeline, from ideas to edit to music, from just a mood board.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Creators, small brands and hobbyists who have a visual style in mind but no video editing time.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot plans with image and video generation; long videos use more of your weekly allowance.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/dvorahfr/status/2118223967890575488" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @dvorahfr on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-turns-style-images-into-music-video/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
