    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/aether-cloud-devboxes-existing-subscription/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Aether runs Claude Code or Codex in a cloud box you can watch, on the plan you already pay for</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Aether gives each coding-agent task its own Firecracker microVM with a live terminal, file tree, port previews and optional SSH. It runs Claude Code, Codex or OpenCode on the Claude or ChatGPT subscription (or API key) you already have, and only bills machine time. Warm slots start a task in about five seconds; founder Pranav Sharan&#039;s launch post cites ~20 seconds from prompt to a running stack on a public benchmark. Optional review agents comment on PRs with before/after screenshots and browser video, and a Free plan includes about 4 hours of Small-devbox time a month.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> You can close the laptop and still steer the agent from your phone, without paying a second AI bill on top of Claude or ChatGPT.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers who already pay for Claude or ChatGPT and want cloud agents they can watch, SSH into and review on the PR.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone who signs up at runaether.dev. Amount: Free plan is $0 with 20 credits/month (about 4 hours on the default Small box), 1 warm slot, 3 tasks at once. Afterwards: Starter $30, Pro $75, Max $120 per month for more credits; credit packs $0.10 each. Idle boxes bill $0. Checked on runaether.dev and the founder launch post on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.runaether.dev/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Aether on www.runaether.dev ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/aether-cloud-devboxes-existing-subscription/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Aether%20runs%20Claude%20Code%20or%20Codex%20in%20a%20cloud%20box%20you%20can%20watch%2C%20on%20the%20plan%20you%20already%20pay%20for&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Faether-cloud-devboxes-existing-subscription%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
