            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People watching OpenAI pricing, and households that currently buy multiple individual ChatGPT plans.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to: not launched. Spotted only in ChatGPT web checkout pricing config as of November 4, 2026. No official seat count, sharing rules or start date. Pricing figures circulating in community posts mirror current individual tiers and should not be treated as confirmed family pricing. Checked via the original X post and follow-ups on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
