    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/serpkite-1000-free-serp-credits-mcp/" class="hover:text-brand-600">SerpKite gives agents 1,000 free Google SERP credits a month, with MCP built in</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">SerpKite is a Google SERP API built for AI agents: one call returns web, news, images, Maps, Shopping, Scholar and related results as JSON or Markdown, plus endpoints that capture what ChatGPT, Gemini and Google AI Mode answer. A remote MCP server uses the same credits, so Claude Code, Cursor and other MCP clients can search without a custom scraper. New accounts get free credits with no card; failed and empty requests are refunded, and purchased credits never expire.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Agent search usually means brittle scrapers or pricey SERP bills. A free monthly credit bucket with MCP is enough to prototype real research tools.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers wiring web search into Claude Code, Cursor, Codex or other MCP clients.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Who qualifies: anyone who verifies email (disposable addresses blocked). Amount: 1,000 free credits at signup, 1,500 more when you link GitHub or Google, then 1,000 free credits every month; free keys capped at 5 requests/sec. Deadline: none. Afterwards: pay-as-you-go packs from $10 for 10K credits (never expire); failed/empty requests free. Checked on serpkite.com/pricing on November 6, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://serpkite.com/pricing" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @SerpKite on serpkite.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/serpkite-1000-free-serp-credits-mcp/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=SerpKite%20gives%20agents%201%2C000%20free%20Google%20SERP%20credits%20a%20month%2C%20with%20MCP%20built%20in&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fserpkite-1000-free-serp-credits-mcp%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
