                                <article id="code-greg-isenberg-agent-run-company-stack" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-03" class="text-slate-400">Nov 3, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-greg-isenberg-agent-run-company-stack/" class="hover:text-brand-600">&quot;I talk to my agents more than my human teammates&quot;: Greg Isenberg shared the full agent stack running his 50-person company, and 11,000 people saved it</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Founder Greg Isenberg, whose team is 50+ people in 12 countries, posted how product work at his company is now agent-managed. Ideas start as a voice note to Grok Bot; an agent interrogates the idea, drops a spec into Linear and reads competitors&#039; sites and reviews. Claude Code with a design MCP makes 4 versions of every screen, a fleet of agents builds in parallel git worktrees, and agents click through previews as impatient, confused and mobile personas. Sentry errors become fix PRs a human approves, and every morning an agent reviews the funnel. His rules: one agent per platform, a cheap model for triage, Opus for anything that ships, and every mistake becomes a new skill. Humans handle creative feedback and relationships. The post passed 11,000 bookmarks.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a concrete, end-to-end blueprint rather than a vague &#039;we use AI&#039; claim, and the habits (one agent per job, score every output, turn mistakes into skills) work even if you copy only one step.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders, product leads and small teams who want to move more of their product loop onto agents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">The tools he lists (Grok Bot, Claude Code, Linear, Sentry, PostHog, Stripe MCP and others) each have their own plans, and many are open source or have free tiers. It&#039;s his own setup and his own description.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/gregisenberg/status/2117734977312047537" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Greg Isenberg (@gregisenberg) on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-greg-isenberg-agent-run-company-stack/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=%22I%20talk%20to%20my%20agents%20more%20than%20my%20human%20teammates%22%3A%20Greg%20Isenberg%20shared%20the%20full%20agent%20stack%20running%20his%2050-person%20company%2C%20and%2011%2C000%20people%20saved%20it&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcode-greg-isenberg-agent-run-company-stack%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
