                                <article id="antigravity-remote-agents-voice-mode-2-29" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-03" class="text-slate-400">Nov 3, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/antigravity-remote-agents-voice-mode-2-29/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Close your laptop, the agent keeps coding: Antigravity adds cloud remote agents and voice mode</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Antigravity App 2.29.0, released November 3, adds remote agents. Conversations in a cloud project run on Google&#039;s servers instead of your machine, so a task keeps going after you close the app, and you can check on it from any browser at antigravity.google.com/remote. The same release starts rolling out a voice mode powered by Gemini Live, which you open from the button in an empty message box, plus a Jupyter notebook viewer and redesigned Automations that you can set to Scheduled, Always on or Paused.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Long agent runs used to die when your laptop went to sleep. Cloud agents you can check from a phone browser put Antigravity in the same league as Codex cloud tasks and Claude Code on the web.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Antigravity users on Google AI Pro or Ultra who run long coding tasks or want to check on agents away from their desk.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Remote agents are rolling out to Google AI Ultra and Pro subscribers. Voice mode is rolling out gradually. Both need Antigravity App 2.29.0 or later.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://antigravity.google/docs/changelog" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @antigravity on antigravity.google ↗</a>
