                                <article id="bot-booked-same-day-doctor-appointment-while-driving" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-03" class="text-slate-400">Nov 3, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-booked-same-day-doctor-appointment-while-driving/" class="hover:text-brand-600">While he drove, Grok Bot phoned a pediatric orthopedist and got his daughter seen the same day</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Min Choi says his daughter hurt her foot at dance practice, so he described her symptoms to Grok Bot while driving. The Bot suggested nearby clinics, including a pediatric orthopedist with X-rays on site, and offered to call when they opened. It made the call, got a 9:30 appointment that same day, and asked him follow-up questions in real time when the receptionist needed details. It also asked about insurance, payment options and pricing, had the intake forms emailed to him, and put the visit on his calendar. He says the receptionist knew the call was recorded, and he could replay it afterwards.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Booking a doctor is the kind of call that&#039;s urgent, fiddly and impossible while driving. It&#039;s a clear real-life example of what Grok Bot&#039;s phone calls feature can do once you&#039;re there to answer its questions live.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Busy parents and anyone who needs appointments booked but can&#039;t sit on the phone.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Uses Grok Bot&#039;s built-in phone calls (Grok Bot 0.77 or later) on a plan that includes Grok Bot. Results depend on the clinic and your account&#039;s rollout.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/minchoi/status/2117633564736938471" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @minchoi on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-booked-same-day-doctor-appointment-while-driving/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=While%20he%20drove%2C%20Grok%20Bot%20phoned%20a%20pediatric%20orthopedist%20and%20got%20his%20daughter%20seen%20the%20same%20day&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-booked-same-day-doctor-appointment-while-driving%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Find three nearby [type of clinic] options that can see [who] today. When I pick one, call them to book the earliest slot. Ask me before sharing any personal or insurance details, and add the appointment to my calendar." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
