                                <article id="blockworks-mcp-free-100-dollars-credits" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-03" class="text-slate-400">Nov 3, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/blockworks-mcp-free-100-dollars-credits/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Blockworks opens its crypto data MCP to everyone, with $100 of free credits to try it</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Blockworks, the crypto research and data company, has opened its MCP server to everyone. Anyone who claims the offer gets 10,000 credits, worth $100, to ask an AI assistant about token, protocol and market data from Blockworks&#039; datasets. It works as a ChatGPT plugin from the directory and as an MCP server at mcp.blockworks.com/mcp in Claude, Cursor and other MCP clients. You can track credit use by day and by dataset in your account. It&#039;s a research tool, not a trading tool, and nothing it returns is investment advice.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Good crypto data usually sits behind expensive terminals. Being able to ask your assistant questions about it for free for a month is a cheap way to see whether MCP data tools are worth paying for.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Crypto researchers, analysts and developers who want to query market and protocol data from ChatGPT, Claude or Cursor.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free: 10,000 credits ($100), one claim per account. Credits expire 30 days after you claim them. When they run out, Blockworks asks you to book time with its team for full access; no public price is listed. Checked on Blockworks&#039; announcement November 4, 2026. Not investment advice.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://blockworks.com/insights/we-re-opening-up-blockworks-mcp-to-everyone" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Blockworks on blockworks.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/blockworks-mcp-free-100-dollars-credits/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Blockworks%20opens%20its%20crypto%20data%20MCP%20to%20everyone%2C%20with%20%24100%20of%20free%20credits%20to%20try%20it&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fblockworks-mcp-free-100-dollars-credits%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
