                                <article id="code-cursor-codex-lagos-portfolio-sword-game" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="coding">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Coding</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-02" class="text-slate-400">Nov 2, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-cursor-codex-lagos-portfolio-sword-game/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A Lagos designer rebuilt his portfolio with Claude Code, Cursor and Codex, and it comes with a sword game and a dragon</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Product designer and design engineer Egbemode Abayomi, based in Lagos, rebuilt his portfolio site with three AI coding agents: Claude Code, Cursor and Codex. It has real case studies with numbers, a playable sword game with a live leaderboard, and a dragon character that tells visitors facts about him. His post got nearly 90,000 views and more than 1,100 bookmarks in a few hours, mostly from designers asking how he split the work between the agents. The site is live at egbemodeyomi.com.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A portfolio people actually play with gets remembered. Coding agents let a designer ship the interactive ideas that used to need a front-end developer and a few weekends.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Designers, students and job seekers who want a portfolio that stands out without hiring a developer.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">The site is free to visit. Claude Code, Cursor and Codex each need their own account; all three have paid plans and some free usage. He hasn&#039;t published his exact prompts or how long the build took.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/its_YOGO/status/2117183124228435990" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Egbemode Abayomi (@its_YOGO) on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-cursor-codex-lagos-portfolio-sword-game/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20Lagos%20designer%20rebuilt%20his%20portfolio%20with%20Claude%20Code%2C%20Cursor%20and%20Codex%2C%20and%20it%20comes%20with%20a%20sword%20game%20and%20a%20dragon&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcode-cursor-codex-lagos-portfolio-sword-game%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Build a one-page portfolio for me with three case studies (problem, what I did, the result in numbers). Then add a small browser mini game in a separate section with a simple leaderboard. Keep it fast on mobile." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
