        <a href="https://openai.com/index/rewarding-defenders-with-bigger-bug-bounties/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @OpenAI on openai.com ↗</a>
