                                <article id="codex-banked-reset-redeem-later" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-01" class="text-slate-400">Nov 1, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-banked-reset-redeem-later/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Codex is handing out banked free usage resets: you don&#039;t have to use yours now, here&#039;s how to save it for a crunch</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">OpenAI&#039;s Codex lead Tibo posted &quot;Banked 1/2&quot; on November 1, after saying the next two days would bring banked resets. A banked reset is a free, one-time Codex reset saved to your account for later instead of applied right away. When you redeem it, Go restores its monthly allowance, Plus and Business Standard restore the 5-hour and weekly allowances, and Pro restores the weekly allowance. You can redeem it from the Codex desktop app, the web usage settings or the CLI, as long as at least one allowance is below 80% remaining. A second banked reset is hinted for the next day.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Saving the reset for a heavy week is worth far more than burning it on a quiet day, and knowing the 80% rule stops you from wondering why the button is greyed out.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">ChatGPT Go, Plus, Business and Pro users who code with Codex and sometimes run out of limit mid-project.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free; OpenAI decides which accounts get banked resets and didn&#039;t publish eligibility for this round, so check your own usage page. Redeeming moves your weekly refresh date, and each banked reset has an expiry date shown in your account. Not available on mobile. Checked November 1, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001498-how-resets-work-in-codex" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: OpenAI Help Center; announced by Tibo (@thsottiaux) on help.openai.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-banked-reset-redeem-later/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Codex%20is%20handing%20out%20banked%20free%20usage%20resets%3A%20you%20don%27t%20have%20to%20use%20yours%20now%2C%20here%27s%20how%20to%20save%20it%20for%20a%20crunch&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fcodex-banked-reset-redeem-later%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
