                                <article id="antigravity-deepmind-antimicrobial-peptide-wet-lab-plan" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="research">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Research</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-01" class="text-slate-400">Nov 1, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/antigravity-deepmind-antimicrobial-peptide-wet-lab-plan/" class="hover:text-brand-600">DeepMind scientists used Antigravity to find a new antimicrobial peptide and plan the lab test in minutes</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google&#039;s Antigravity team posted a 6-minute demo of Google DeepMind researchers using the agentic coding app for biology. The agent searched millions of uncharacterized proteins, helped validate a new antimicrobial peptide candidate and wrote a wet-lab experiment plan in minutes. To check the molecules while the agent worked, the researchers used Antigravity UI sidecars to build an interactive 3D biomolecular structure viewer right inside the workspace.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows a coding agent doing real science work: searching huge datasets, building its own visual tools on the fly and handing back a plan a lab can run. UI sidecars are the takeaway for any field that needs to look at data while an agent works.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Biologists, bioinformaticians and research engineers, plus anyone who wants custom viewers next to their agent.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Antigravity is Google&#039;s agentic development app; the demo uses DeepMind&#039;s own data. Antigravity has a free plan; check antigravity.google for current plans and limits.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/antigravity/status/2116952756342677919" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @antigravity on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/gemini/antigravity-deepmind-antimicrobial-peptide-wet-lab-plan/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
