                                <article id="kiro-kiroween-hackathon-4000-free-credits" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-31" class="text-slate-400">Oct 31, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/kiro-kiroween-hackathon-4000-free-credits/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Kiroween hackathon: request 4,000 free Kiro credits to build with Claude models, plus a shot at $100,000 in prizes</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Kiro, the agentic IDE from AWS, is running its Kiroween hackathon on Devpost, and every registered participant can request a one-time grant of 4,000 Kiro credits to build their entry. That&#039;s four times the 1,000 monthly credits in the $20 Kiro Pro plan. Kiro lets you pick Anthropic&#039;s Claude models (Opus, Sonnet and Haiku), GPT-5.6 and open weight models, each with its own credit multiplier. The hackathon has $100,000 in cash prizes, submissions are open until December 4, and there&#039;s a live build session on November 11 at 10 AM PT.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> 4,000 credits is a lot of agent time with Claude and other frontier models, free, for anyone willing to build and submit a project.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers, solo or in teams of up to 3, who want to try Kiro&#039;s spec-driven agent workflow without paying for credits.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free for registered Kiroween participants, one grant per person. Request by Tuesday, December 1, 2026, 12:00 PM PT; requests are reviewed within 48 business hours and must be redeemed by December 4. Credits expire December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM PT. You need a Kiro account plus your Kiro user ID or AWS account ID, and availability varies by region. After that, Kiro Free is 50 credits a month and Kiro Pro is $20 a month for 1,000 credits. Checked November 1, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://kiroween.devpost.com/resources" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Kiro (AWS) on Devpost on kiroween.devpost.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/kiro-kiroween-hackathon-4000-free-credits/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Kiroween%20hackathon%3A%20request%204%2C000%20free%20Kiro%20credits%20to%20build%20with%20Claude%20models%2C%20plus%20a%20shot%20at%20%24100%2C000%20in%20prizes&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fkiro-kiroween-hackathon-4000-free-credits%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
