                                <article id="bot-iphone-shortcut-sees-your-screen" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="productivity">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-31" class="text-slate-400">Oct 31, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-iphone-shortcut-sees-your-screen/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A free iPhone shortcut lets your Grok Bot see your screen: hold the Action Button and ask about the video or post you&#039;re on</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Builder @everestchris6 made a free, open-source iPhone shortcut that sends what&#039;s on your screen to your Grok Bot when you hold the Action Button. You can then ask about the video you&#039;re watching, have it break down an article, or tell it to build something you saw in a reel for your business. He says it can watch videos, read posts and check the web, and it&#039;s fully customizable, for example to talk back while you scroll. His post passed 2,800 likes and 1.6 million views. It&#039;s a community shortcut, not a built-in Grok Bot feature.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It turns Grok Bot into a screen-aware helper on your phone with one button, without copying links or taking screenshots by hand.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot users with an iPhone that has an Action Button (iPhone 15 Pro and later) who often want help with what they&#039;re looking at.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">The shortcut is free, but Grok Bot itself needs a paid plan of The X Subscription. Each press sends a capture of your screen, so avoid using it on banking, passwords or private messages. Get it from the link in the creator&#039;s thread.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: shared by its creator on X; we haven&#039;t tested the shortcut ourselves.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/everestchris6/status/2116183923747422477" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Chris (@everestchris6) on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-iphone-shortcut-sees-your-screen/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20free%20iPhone%20shortcut%20lets%20your%20Grok%20Bot%20see%20your%20screen%3A%20hold%20the%20Action%20Button%20and%20ask%20about%20the%20video%20or%20post%20you%27re%20on&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-iphone-shortcut-sees-your-screen%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="I&#039;m sending you a screenshot of what&#039;s on my iPhone screen. Summarize it in three bullets, tell me what it is trying to get me to do, and list anything I should double-check before acting on it." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
</div>
</article>
                                <article id="zro-free-daily-deepseek-glm-flash-claude-code" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-31" class="text-slate-400">Oct 31, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/zro-free-daily-deepseek-glm-flash-claude-code/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free every day: run Claude Code on DeepSeek V4.1 Flash or GLM-5.3 Flash through Zro, no card needed</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Zro, an inference service from MoonMath, now gives its Free plan daily usage on two fast open models, GLM-5.3 Flash and DeepSeek V4.1 Flash. The allowance resets every day and you only need an account and an API key. Zro&#039;s API is OpenAI-compatible and also has a Messages endpoint, and its CLI can start Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, OpenCode and other agents pointed at Zro with one command. Zro says it keeps zero request retention and doesn&#039;t train on requests. It doesn&#039;t publish the exact size of the free daily allowance.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a no-cost way to keep a coding agent busy on cheap, fast models for side projects, scripts and experiments without touching your paid Claude limits.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers who want a free daily model budget for Claude Code, OpenCode, Cursor or their own scripts, and anyone comparing open models on real tasks.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free plan with daily usage on GLM-5.3 Flash and DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, resetting every day; the exact daily amount isn&#039;t published and there&#039;s no stated end date. Paid options: Pro $20/month and Max $60/month, plus usage packs from $5 that expire after 90 days. These are Zro&#039;s own models, not Anthropic&#039;s, even when you run them inside Claude Code. Checked November 1, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://zro.moonmath.ai/pricing" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Zro by MoonMath (@zroai_) on zro.moonmath.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/zro-free-daily-deepseek-glm-flash-claude-code/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Free%20every%20day%3A%20run%20Claude%20Code%20on%20DeepSeek%20V4.1%20Flash%20or%20GLM-5.3%20Flash%20through%20Zro%2C%20no%20card%20needed&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fzro-free-daily-deepseek-glm-flash-claude-code%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Help me install the Zro CLI, log in and start Claude Code on deepseek-v4.1-flash with zro launch, then confirm which model is answering and remind me Zro doesn&#039;t publish the daily free limit." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
