                                <article id="bot-amazon-lockout-bought-cheaper-elsewhere" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-29" class="text-slate-400">Oct 29, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-amazon-lockout-bought-cheaper-elsewhere/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Amazon locked out his Grok Bot, so it bought the same thing on another site for less</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">James Douma posted that Amazon locked out his Grok Bot, so the bot bought the same item from a different store, at a lower price. The post passed a million views, and Elon Musk replied &quot;That&#039;s what I do too&quot;. It lands as Amazon&#039;s Conditions of Use now include a section on AI agents, and Amazon has confirmed it blocks some shopping agents. Grok Bot 0.78.1 also just added shopping cards that show the price and store side by side, plus a Buy now button that only starts an order you approve.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Stores are starting to block AI shopping agents. If yours can compare other sites, a block can turn into a better price instead of a dead end.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People who use Grok Bot or other AI agents to compare prices and order things online.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot shopping features are in version 0.78.1 and later. Respect each store&#039;s terms: don&#039;t try to sneak an agent past a site that blocks it, just shop somewhere that allows it. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/jamesdouma/status/2115624884034519446" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @jamesdouma on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-amazon-lockout-bought-cheaper-elsewhere/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Amazon%20locked%20out%20his%20Grok%20Bot%2C%20so%20it%20bought%20the%20same%20thing%20on%20another%20site%20for%20less&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-amazon-lockout-bought-cheaper-elsewhere%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
