                                <article id="spawn-10-people-3-1m-tokens-77000-changes" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-29" class="text-slate-400">Oct 29, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/spawn-10-people-3-1m-tokens-77000-changes/" class="hover:text-brand-600">10 people, $3.1M in tokens a month: Spawn says its AI agent &#039;fleet&#039; shipped 77,000 changes in 30 days</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Jacob Sansbury, founder of the AI game platform Spawn, published an X article saying his ten-person company spends about 30x its payroll on AI tokens, $3.1 million last month, and shipped 77,000 substantial changes to players in 30 days, about 108 an hour. The work is done by what he calls the fleet: permanent agents that each own one area, like the engine, finance, bug triage or deploys, keep a memory of what they&#039;ve done, and start swarms of helper agents. He says the agents fix errors users hit and check their own work, and that it only started working with Anthropic&#039;s newer models.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s one of the clearest public looks at a company run mostly by long-lived agents, and at what that costs in tokens.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders, engineering leads and anyone deciding how much work to hand to AI agents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">These are the founder&#039;s own figures, not audited. The idea of giving one agent one area it fully owns works with Claude Code, Codex or Grok Bot on your own plan. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/jsnnsa/status/2115624020699910223" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @jsnnsa on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/spawn-10-people-3-1m-tokens-77000-changes/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=10%20people%2C%20%243.1M%20in%20tokens%20a%20month%3A%20Spawn%20says%20its%20AI%20agent%20%27fleet%27%20shipped%2077%2C000%20changes%20in%2030%20days&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fspawn-10-people-3-1m-tokens-77000-changes%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="You own bug triage for this repo. Read the new issues since your last run, label each by area and severity, link duplicates, and append what you did to notes/triage.md. Don&#039;t change code; flag anything that needs a human." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
