    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/muse/spark-open-816b-open-math-os/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Meta&#039;s Muse Spark Open, an 816B model with a 1M context, is now available to approved math research teams</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">SAIR, the group behind Open Math OS, announced that Muse Spark Open from Meta is now available on its platform to all approved teams. SAIR lists it at 816 billion total parameters with 42 billion active per token, which points to a mixture-of-experts design, and a 1 million token context window. Teams apply for access to Open Math OS through SAIR&#039;s application page. For math researchers, that means a very large open-weight Muse model with room for long proofs and papers in one context, inside a platform built for math research.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A frontier-scale Muse model with a 1M context, offered to research teams, gives mathematicians another serious option for long-form reasoning without building their own infrastructure.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Mathematicians, university and lab research teams, and anyone working on AI for math.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Available on Open Math OS to approved teams only; you apply through SAIR. SAIR&#039;s post doesn&#039;t list pricing or eligibility rules, and we couldn&#039;t load the application page when we checked. Checked October 30, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: announced by SAIR on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed access terms.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/SAIRfoundation/status/2115886474600362117" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @SAIRfoundation on X ↗</a>
