    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/business-plugin-credits-up-to-500/" class="hover:text-brand-600">ChatGPT Business teams can grab up to $500 in free credits just by trying a few plugins</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">OpenAI is running a limited-time offer for ChatGPT Business workspaces: accept the banner offer on a promoted partner plugin, install it, and complete one real, successful workflow with it within 7 days, and your workspace gets $50 in promotional credits. Participating plugins are Stripe, Intuit QuickBooks, HubSpot, Gusto, Dropbox, Canva, PayPal and Oracle QuickStart. Limits stack by group: up to $100 per workspace across the first six, up to $150 for PayPal (U.S. only) and up to $250 for Oracle QuickStart, so a workspace can reach $500 in total. The credits work for ChatGPT Work, Codex, ChatGPT for Excel or Sheets, ChatGPT for PowerPoint and Workspace Agents.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s free usage for tools many small businesses already pay for, and the credits can go toward Codex and agent work, not just chat.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">ChatGPT Business members and admins whose teams use Stripe, QuickBooks, HubSpot, Gusto, Dropbox, Canva, PayPal or Oracle.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Any ChatGPT Business seat (Standard, Premium or legacy Codex) can qualify if a banner appears; only eligible users see it. You&#039;re not eligible if the plugin is already installed or connected when you accept. No end date is given: it runs while the campaign is active and credits remain. Credits expire 30 days after redemption and aren&#039;t API credits or cash. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001514-chatgpt-business-plugin-credit-promotions" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @OpenAI on help.openai.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/business-plugin-credits-up-to-500/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=ChatGPT%20Business%20teams%20can%20grab%20up%20to%20%24500%20in%20free%20credits%20just%20by%20trying%20a%20few%20plugins&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fbusiness-plugin-credits-up-to-500%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="I just connected the Stripe plugin. Pull a report of last month&#039;s payments, grouped by week, with totals and refunds, so I can check the numbers against our books." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
</div>
