                                <article id="bot-0-78-cancel-free-trials-unused-subscriptions" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="productivity">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-28" class="text-slate-400">Oct 28, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-0-78-cancel-free-trials-unused-subscriptions/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Grok Bot can now start a free trial for you and cancel it before you&#039;re charged</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Grok Bot 0.78.1 adds three subscription templates. &quot;Try it, don&#039;t pay for it&quot; signs you up for a free trial and cancels it, or reminds you, before the first charge. &quot;Find unused subscriptions&quot; looks for plans you&#039;re paying for but not using and cancels the ones you pick. &quot;Watch subscription prices&quot; keeps an eye on renewal prices. The same release adds shopping cards with photos, ratings, price, store and badges, a Buy now button that starts an order you approve, order tracking cards, and Shop Pay in the Vault Payments tab. The bot confirms with you before it changes anything.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Forgotten free trials and unused subscriptions quietly cost people money every month. Handing the reminder and the cancelling to a bot fixes that.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Anyone who signs up for trials and forgets them, or pays for streaming and app subscriptions they barely use.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot users on version 0.78.1 or later. You approve each cancellation and each purchase before the bot acts. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.ai/changelog/bot#v0.78.1" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @xAI on x.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-0-78-cancel-free-trials-unused-subscriptions/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
