                                <article id="ai-for-science-free-credits-20-partners" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="research">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Research</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-28" class="text-slate-400">Oct 28, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/ai-for-science-free-credits-20-partners/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Anthropic is handing out free Claude credits to scientists through 20 partners, including Sloan, Simons and the NSF</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic expanded its AI for Science program, which gives free Claude credits to researchers on high-impact projects, from individual scientists to 20 foundations, institutions and research groups. Six funders and societies (the Alfred P. Sloan Foundation, the Simons Foundation, Schmidt Sciences, the Open Source for Science Fund, the US National Science Foundation and CAS) will pass Claude credits on to researchers they pick. Six institutions, including the Space Telescope Science Institute, the Wellcome Sanger Institute, the Francis Crick Institute and EMBL, will use credits in-house. Six projects get credits directly, among them FlyWire at Princeton, gnomAD at the Broad Institute and Tau Ceti, a community library of math proofs in Lean.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If your lab or grant runs through one of these funders or institutes, free Claude credits for data analysis, hypotheses and coding may already be within reach.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Scientists, research software engineers and lab leads in biology, medicine, physics, climate, chemistry and math.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free Claude credits, handed out by the named partner organizations to researchers they choose; Anthropic gives no fixed amount or deadline. Anthropic also offers a discounted Team plan for scientists. Normal Claude pricing applies once credits run out. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @AnthropicAI on www.anthropic.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/ai-for-science-free-credits-20-partners/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Anthropic%20is%20handing%20out%20free%20Claude%20credits%20to%20scientists%20through%2020%20partners%2C%20including%20Sloan%2C%20Simons%20and%20the%20NSF&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fai-for-science-free-credits-20-partners%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
