                                <article id="suno-mcp-make-songs-in-chatgpt-claude" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="images">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Images &amp; media</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-28" class="text-slate-400">Oct 28, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/suno-mcp-make-songs-in-chatgpt-claude/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Make a whole song without leaving Claude or ChatGPT: Suno&#039;s new MCP connector needs no API key</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Suno launched Suno MCP in beta, a connector that lets Claude, ChatGPT, Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini and other MCP apps create music in the chat you&#039;re already in. Describe a song in plain words or work out the lyrics and style with your assistant, and Suno makes it. You can also upload a voice memo or loop and turn it into a full song, or make covers, extensions and mashups of songs in your library. Every song saves to your Suno library, and you can ask how many credits you have left. You connect by signing in to Suno, with no API key or code.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Your assistant already knows the lyrics, video plan or project you&#039;ve been discussing, so it can turn that into a finished track without copy-pasting between tabs.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Creators, video makers, marketers and hobbyists who want custom music from the AI they already use.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Beta, available on all Suno plans including Free. Songs use your normal Suno credits. Some AI apps only allow custom connectors on certain paid plans. Checked October 29, 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://suno.com/mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @suno on suno.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/suno-mcp-make-songs-in-chatgpt-claude/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
