                                <article id="codex-charakuru-drawing-to-3d-vrm-avatar" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="images">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Images &amp; media</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-27" class="text-slate-400">Oct 27, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-charakuru-drawing-to-3d-vrm-avatar/" class="hover:text-brand-600">One drawing in, rigged 3D avatar out: Charakuru lets Codex run Tripo and Blender for you</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Charakuru is a kit by Japanese creator Nano that turns one full-body character illustration into a rigged VRM avatar. You work in a local app and hand each step to Codex, which paints eight reference images, operates Tripo in the browser to make 3D candidates, then drives Blender for weights, physics and VRM export. You don&#039;t operate Blender yourself, and the agent always stops at checkpoints: it never picks a candidate for you, so you choose the head and body versions, check proportions and watch a walk cycle. It isn&#039;t a standard open-source licence: individuals and businesses with annual revenue and total funding both under ¥100 million can use it free, while larger companies need a written agreement.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Rigging a 3D character used to mean learning Blender. Now an agent handles the tedious parts and you only make the creative calls.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">VTubers, indie game developers and illustrators who want a 3D model of their own character.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free download from GitHub under the kit&#039;s own licence (larger businesses need a separate agreement). You also need Codex with image generation and browser control, your own Tripo account (its fees apply), Blender 5.2 with the VRM add-on and Blender MCP, and Node.js 22+.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://github.com/nanocle/Charakuru" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @nanocle on github.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-charakuru-drawing-to-3d-vrm-avatar/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=One%20drawing%20in%2C%20rigged%203D%20avatar%20out%3A%20Charakuru%20lets%20Codex%20run%20Tripo%20and%20Blender%20for%20you&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fcodex-charakuru-drawing-to-3d-vrm-avatar%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Read the root AGENTS.md and help me start creating a character with this kit." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
