            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Catch me up on my iCloud inbox from the last 24 hours: list anything that needs a reply from me, then check my calendar for tomorrow and tell me if anything clashes." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
