        <time datetime="2026-10-27" class="text-slate-400">Oct 27, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-referral-free-usage-reset/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Out of Grok Bot usage? Refer a friend and earn a free usage reset (they get 2 weeks of Premium free)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Grok Bot now has a referral program. Share your personal link, and a friend who is new to Grok gets a 2-week free trial of Premium on The X Subscription, including the Grok Bot app. When that friend becomes a paid subscriber, you earn one free usage reset, which restores your included weekly pool. The reward shows as pending first and is added 7 days after their payment, and each reset stays valid for 6 months. If the payment is refunded or disputed, the reward is removed, and rewards have no cash value.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Hitting the weekly usage cap is the most common Grok Bot complaint. A reset is a legitimate, free way to get your pool back without upgrading plans.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">US-based Grok Bot users on a paid Premium, Super or Ultra plan, and friends who want to try Grok Bot free for two weeks.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Live now. Referrer: US-based, on a paid Premium, Super or Ultra plan of The X Subscription, at least 7 days after checkout (legacy Cursor or SuperGrok plans, Plus and Team can&#039;t refer yet). Friend: new to Grok, any country except China, eligible email, credit card required; card is charged after the 2-week trial unless canceled (a reminder comes 7 days before). App Store and Google Play purchases don&#039;t count. xAI may change or end the program at any time.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://docs.x.ai/x-subscription/referral-program" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @SpaceXSI on docs.x.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-referral-free-usage-reset/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Out%20of%20Grok%20Bot%20usage%3F%20Refer%20a%20friend%20and%20earn%20a%20free%20usage%20reset%20%28they%20get%202%20weeks%20of%20Premium%20free%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-referral-free-usage-reset%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Write a short, honest message I can send a friend explaining what Grok Bot did for me this week, with one concrete example, and mention they can try it free for two weeks with my link." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
</div>
