    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-27" class="text-slate-400">Oct 27, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/gavin-baker-17-grok-bots/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Investor Gavin Baker runs 17 Grok Bots and calls it his firm&#039;s most impactful AI product yet</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A clip shared by @firesidealpha shows investor Gavin Baker saying Grok Bot is the most impactful AI product he and his firm have had yet. Per the post&#039;s transcript, he said he had glued things together with Claude Code before, but Grok Bot &quot;just makes it so easy,&quot; that he&#039;s up to about 17 Grok Bots, and that he thinks of a new one to add every day. The post passed 6 million views after Elon Musk quoted it with &quot;Grok @Bot rocks.&quot;</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s a high-profile, non-engineer example of the multi-bot pattern: lots of small, single-job bots instead of one do-everything assistant.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Investors, executives and busy professionals wondering how people actually use several personal agents at once.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">The clip is free to watch on X. Grok Bot requires a paid plan; how many Bots you can run depends on your usage allowance.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2115167081780093145" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @firesidealpha on X ↗</a>
