        <a href="/trending/cursor/deepseek-v4-1-flash/" class="hover:text-brand-600">DeepSeek V4.1 Flash lands in Cursor: up to 47.7% on CursorBench for under $1 a task</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cursor added DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, a DeepSeek coding model with several effort levels. Cursor says every effort level sits on its CursorBench 4.0 cost frontier, at $0.60 to $0.98 per task, with no model scoring higher at those prices. Cursor&#039;s chart puts the top (max) level at 47.7% for $0.98 a task.</p>
