                                <article id="launches-in-japan" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="muse" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/muse/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/15 dark:text-violet-300">Muse</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-23" class="text-slate-400">Oct 23, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/muse/launches-in-japan/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Muse launches in Japan, its first country outside North America</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Meta launched Muse, its personal AI agent, in Japan on October 23 on iOS, Android and muse.ai. It&#039;s the first market after the North America launch in September. Muse plans and carries out tasks like sending email, booking travel and shopping, and keeps working after you close the app. Connectors include Gmail, Google Calendar, Instagram, Stripe, Shopify, Trip.com, Agoda and Klook, and Meta says Mercari, Money Forward ME and Ticket Pia integrations are coming.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Personal agents are going global fast, and local connectors like Mercari show they&#039;re being built for everyday errands, not just English-speaking power users.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People in Japan who want an agent for travel, shopping and scheduling, and anyone tracking where Muse is available.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Japan, from Oct 23, 2026, on iOS, Android and muse.ai. Many core features are free, with paid subscriptions for more.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://about.fb.com/ja/news/2026/10/muse-personal-ai-agent-launches-in-japan/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Meta on about.fb.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/muse/launches-in-japan/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Muse%20launches%20in%20Japan%2C%20its%20first%20country%20outside%20North%20America&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fmuse%2Flaunches-in-japan%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
