    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-mcp-tasks-elicitations/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Code can now hand slow jobs to plugins and keep working (MCP Tasks)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic added MCP Tasks and Elicitations to Claude Code. With Tasks, a connected tool can accept a long job, like a deep research run, a report export or a build, and hand control straight back, so Claude keeps working while the job runs and picks up the result when it lands. With Elicitations, a tool can stop partway and ask you a question in a small dialog, such as confirming a refund or filling in a missing detail.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Slow tools no longer freeze your session, and risky steps can wait for a clear yes from you instead of guessing.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers who build or use MCP servers and plugins with Claude Code in the terminal.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Public beta in the Claude Code CLI (version 2.1.304 or later) and the Agent SDK. Not yet in the VS Code extension or desktop app. The plugin&#039;s server has to add Tasks support; existing tools don&#039;t get it automatically.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2113698001889927608" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @ClaudeDevs on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-mcp-tasks-elicitations/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Claude%20Code%20can%20now%20hand%20slow%20jobs%20to%20plugins%20and%20keep%20working%20%28MCP%20Tasks%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcode-mcp-tasks-elicitations%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
</div>
</article>
