                                <article id="claude-blocked-swedish-government-offices" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-23" class="text-slate-400">Oct 23, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/claude-blocked-swedish-government-offices/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Sweden&#039;s Government Offices block ChatGPT and Claude on staff computers from today</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">From October 26, staff of Sweden&#039;s Government Offices, which include the Prime Minister&#039;s Office and the ministries, can no longer open ChatGPT or Claude in a browser on work computers. They&#039;re pointed to Microsoft Copilot, which passed an internal security review. The digitalisation director says using AI services without a contract puts information security at risk. Some staff can still reach both models through Intric, an internal platform.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows where public-sector AI is heading: consumer chatbots get cut off, and tools covered by a contract and an admin review stay. Sweden&#039;s Tax Agency and the National Board of Institutional Care already have similar blocks.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">IT and security leads, public-sector staff, and anyone writing an AI policy for their organisation.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">News. The Government Offices confirmed the change to SVT. It covers the browser versions only. ChatGPT and Claude are still available to some staff through the internal Intric platform.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.svt.se/nyheter/inrikes/ai-tjanster-sparras-pa-regeringskansliet" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: SVT Nyheter on www.svt.se ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/claude-blocked-swedish-government-offices/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
