                                <article id="codex-twitchcon-hackathon-25k" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="chatgpt" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">ChatGPT</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-23" class="text-slate-400">Oct 23, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-twitchcon-hackathon-25k/" class="hover:text-brand-600">$25,000 for a Twitch app built with Codex: the free online hackathon closes November 2</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">OpenAI and Twitch are running the Codex x TwitchCon Hackathon on Devpost. You use OpenAI Codex to build something Twitch streamers and their communities could really use, and Codex helps set up the Twitch API, EventSub and chat so you can focus on the idea. It&#039;s free to enter and fully online. Prizes total $25,000 in cash: $10,000 for first, $6,000 for second, $4,000 for third and $2,500 each for two runners-up, and the top five are shown at the Codex booth at TwitchCon San Diego on November 15.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s free to enter, the top prize is $10,000, and you don&#039;t need to travel. It&#039;s also a good excuse to learn the Twitch API with Codex doing the setup.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers, designers and streamers who want to build with Codex, solo or in a team.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free to enter. Submissions close November 2, 2026 at 2:00 PM Pacific (November 3 at 2:00 AM Dubai time). Entrants must be of legal age where they live; companies and organizations can&#039;t enter as entrants, and the usual country exclusions apply. You need Codex access, which is limited on ChatGPT Free and Go.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://twitchcon-codex.devpost.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Devpost on twitchcon-codex.devpost.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/codex-twitchcon-hackathon-25k/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=%2425%2C000%20for%20a%20Twitch%20app%20built%20with%20Codex%3A%20the%20free%20online%20hackathon%20closes%20November%202&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fchatgpt%2Fcodex-twitchcon-hackathon-25k%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
