        <time datetime="2026-10-22" class="text-slate-400">Oct 22, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/muse/spark-open-kernel-challenge-100k/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free to enter: $100K Open Kernel Challenge to speed up Muse Spark Open</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Meta, Paradigm and Andromeda are running the Muse Spark Open Kernel Challenge, a free contest to make the open Muse Spark model run faster. The first phase is GPU kernel problems, timed against SGLang on an H200; entries must match the reference output. A second serving track asks for an SGLang diff tested on an 8×H200 node. The prize pool is $100,000: $50,000 plus a signed H200 for first, then $30,000, $10,000, $3,000, $2,000 and $1,000 each for 6th to 10th, and top contestants may get a Meta interview.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Coding agents are good at write, benchmark, repeat loops, which is exactly what kernel tuning is. This is a paid, public scoreboard to test that.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">GPU and inference engineers, and anyone who wants to point a coding agent at a real performance problem.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free to enter with a GitHub sign-in; prize eligibility follows the official rules on openkernelchallenge.dev (checked 2026-10-23). Kernel challenges: Oct 22, 11:00 am to Nov 4, 11:59 pm PT. Serving track: Nov 5, noon to Nov 19, 11:59 pm PT.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://openkernelchallenge.dev/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Meta, Paradigm and Andromeda on openkernelchallenge.dev ↗</a>
