        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-22" class="text-slate-400">Oct 22, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/maps-saved-places-calendar/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Gemini can now pick a spot from your saved Maps places near your next meeting</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">With your permission, Gemini can now look at your Google Maps searches and saved places alongside your Google Calendar to make recommendations for your day. Google&#039;s example: ask which restaurant from your saved list is the best spot for after your meetings today, and Gemini checks where your last meeting is and finds saved places nearby. It&#039;s part of Personal Intelligence, which is opt-in.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Most of us have a saved list we never use. Tying it to where you&#039;ll actually be turns it into a useful suggestion at the right time.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Google Maps and Calendar users who save places and plan their day on the go.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Gemini app with Personal Intelligence turned on, for eligible personal Google accounts. Turn it on at gemini.google.com/personalization-settings.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/GeminiApp/status/2113343041805127839" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @GeminiApp on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/gemini/maps-saved-places-calendar/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Gemini%20can%20now%20pick%20a%20spot%20from%20your%20saved%20Maps%20places%20near%20your%20next%20meeting&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgemini%2Fmaps-saved-places-calendar%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
