    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/for-startups-credits/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Free Grok credits for startups: one balance for Grok, Grok Build, Grok Bot and the API</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">SpaceXSI opened Grok for Startups, a credit program that gives one shared balance you can spend on Grok, Grok Build, Grok Bot and the Grok API. Credits are sized to your stage and current usage, with the stated aim of covering six to twelve months of real use. You get 20% when you&#039;re approved, and the other 80% is released automatically once you&#039;re up and running.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A funded early team could run its coding agents, back-office bots and in-app AI on credits instead of cash for months.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Venture-backed startups with a live product, applying with a company email tied to a Grok team.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Open now, no deadline published. The amount isn&#039;t fixed: SpaceXSI sizes it to your goals and stage. Read the program terms (x.ai/legal/startup-program-terms) for expiry and eligibility details before you apply.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.ai/startups" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @SpaceXSI on x.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/for-startups-credits/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Free%20Grok%20credits%20for%20startups%3A%20one%20balance%20for%20Grok%2C%20Grok%20Build%2C%20Grok%20Bot%20and%20the%20API&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Ffor-startups-credits%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
</div>
</article>
