    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">In a short video from ChatGPT&#039;s official account, Lionel Messi asks ChatGPT to teach him a chess opening that matches how he plays, and it suggests one nicknamed Goat Horns. The idea works for anyone: describe your style, whether you like attacking early, playing safe or setting traps, and ask for one opening to learn, with the first moves and the plan behind them.</p>
