                                <article id="duet-proactive-agent-waitlist" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-21" class="text-slate-400">Oct 21, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/duet-proactive-agent-waitlist/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Duet: Anthropic&#039;s new always-on agent that briefs you each morning (US waitlist)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Claude Duet is a separate app (iOS, Android and claude.ai) where Claude acts as a proactive agent instead of waiting for prompts. Each morning it looks across your connected email and calendar and sends a short brief on what needs you, then keeps watching those apps through the day and messages you only when something matters. You can hand it bigger jobs, like a research brief, a financial model, a slide deck or a dashboard, and it keeps working on its own cloud computer after you close the app. It asks for your approval before it sends a message, makes a payment, signs a document or deletes anything. It runs on Claude Opus 5.5 and reuses the memory, skills and connectors you already set up in Claude.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s Anthropic&#039;s answer to Grok Bot, OpenAI&#039;s dots and Meta&#039;s Muse: an assistant that comes to you with what needs attention, while you keep the final yes on anything that acts for you.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Busy professionals and small-business owners who live in email and calendars and want an assistant that follows up for them.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Research preview by waitlist, US only, for Claude Pro and Max subscribers. Included at no extra cost, but it uses your plan&#039;s usage limits, and its background checks count too. Not on Team or Enterprise yet. Invites go out in waves.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-duet" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on claude.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/duet-proactive-agent-waitlist/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Claude%20Duet%3A%20Anthropic%27s%20new%20always-on%20agent%20that%20briefs%20you%20each%20morning%20%28US%20waitlist%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fduet-proactive-agent-waitlist%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
