        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-21" class="text-slate-400">Oct 21, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/google-maps-carplay/" class="hover:text-brand-600">You can now talk to Gemini in Google Maps on Apple CarPlay</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google Maps on Apple CarPlay now has a Gemini button during navigation. Tap it and you can have a back-and-forth conversation while you drive: find a place to park or refuel, add a stop that matches what you&#039;re craving, report a crash or slowdown, or change your route, for example to avoid tolls. It handles multi-step questions, like asking for a park with a view, whether now is a good time to go, and then starting navigation there. It&#039;s the first voice assistant built into Google Maps on CarPlay.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> iPhone drivers who prefer Google Maps get a real conversational assistant on the car screen, so they can keep their hands on the wheel.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">iPhone users who drive with Google Maps on CarPlay.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Google Maps on CarPlay, available now in the US with a global rollout underway; it may take a few days to reach your phone. Google hasn&#039;t said the new Personal Intelligence features (Gmail, Calendar) are part of the CarPlay version.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/Google/status/2112963255924674955" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Google on X ↗</a>
