    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-dependency-security-watch/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A founder&#039;s security watch: Claude Code lists his dependencies, Grok Bot checks for new risks 4x a day</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">On the day the PHP2Shell flaws went public, a founder shared his setup for keeping up with security news without a security team. He had Claude Code list every platform, package, version and third-party dependency his company uses, then gave that list to Grok Bot as a reference file. Grok Bot checks X, industry sites and trusted security researchers four times a day for anything that could affect those items and pings him when something needs attention. Next on his list: updating the file whenever the stack changes, and opening GitHub issues automatically for things that need a fix.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Small teams usually hear about a critical bug days late. A list of what you actually run, plus a scheduled check against the news, closes that gap cheaply.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders and small dev teams without a dedicated security person.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Needs Claude Code (a Claude Pro plan or higher) and Grok Bot. This is one user&#039;s setup; we haven&#039;t tested it.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/TheCraigHewitt/status/2112932852983582809" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @TheCraigHewitt on X ↗</a>
