    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-name-the-coding-tool/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Installed Claude Code on Grok Bot? Name it in the prompt or the Bot codes on its own</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A tip going around Grok Bot users: if your prompt doesn&#039;t name the coding tool you installed on your Bot&#039;s computer, the Bot often does the coding itself. The post credits a demo where a simple button change never touched the installed CLI. The fix is to open with the tool&#039;s name, like &quot;Use Claude Code to...&quot;, &quot;Use Codex to...&quot; or &quot;Use Grok Build to...&quot;, and check that the Bot says the tool is building it.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you set up a coding CLI on purpose, you want it used. The post says the Bot doing the work itself uses your weekly Bot usage instead.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot users who installed Claude Code, Codex or another coding CLI on their Bot.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot on an eligible plan, plus whichever coding tool you installed and its own plan.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/GrokBotRadar/status/2112833294140403843" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @GrokBotRadar on X ↗</a>
