                                <article id="scorpion-antivenom-binders" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="claude" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-20" class="text-slate-400">Oct 20, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/scorpion-antivenom-binders/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude designed 17 lab-confirmed protein binders against scorpion toxins in 64 hours</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic asked an internal research model in Claude Science to design small proteins that latch onto scorpion neurotoxins, with Citrini Research helping shape the prompt. Working mostly on its own for 64 hours with four follow-up prompts, Claude generated 318,484 designs and picked 180 for testing; the team added 31 more. Two outside labs tested all 211, and 17 met Anthropic&#039;s criteria for a binder, the best two binding in the single-digit nanomolar range. Anthropic is clear that none has been tested for neutralising venom in cells or animals, so this is not an antivenom yet. All 211 designs and their data are public.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows AI agents can now run a real early-stage drug discovery campaign in days, on a neglected disease that kills more than 3,000 people a year, and the data is free for others to build on.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Researchers in biotech and global health, and anyone tracking what AI agents can actually do in science.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to: published research from Anthropic, Oct 20, 2026. The model used is internal, not a public Claude model. Designs and binding data are released for researchers.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-scorpion-toxin-binder-design" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on www.anthropic.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/scorpion-antivenom-binders/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Claude%20designed%2017%20lab-confirmed%20protein%20binders%20against%20scorpion%20toxins%20in%2064%20hours&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fscorpion-antivenom-binders%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
