    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Prompt packs</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-20" class="text-slate-400">Oct 20, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-ten-hypotheses-research-prompt/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Copy the &#039;one lead, 10 sub-agents, one checker&#039; research setup into Grok Bot (prompt included)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A user on X took a pattern he credits to Claude Code creator Boris Cherny, where one agent owns the whole problem and fans the digging out to about ten sub-agents, and ran it in Grok Bot overnight on the question of which SaaS niche to build next. He says the lead Bot wrote 10 hypotheses, sub-Bots researched them across Reddit threads, reviews, job posts and pricing pages, and a checker Bot cut seven, leaving three ideas with evidence attached and no code written. His short prompt asks for 10 hypotheses, one sub-agent each, every claim checked against real data, the top 3 with sources, and nothing built.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> The &#039;build nothing&#039; rule and the checker step keep the agents researching instead of rushing to code, so you pick from evidence, not vibes.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Indie hackers and founders choosing what to build next, or anyone researching a market question.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot on any plan that includes it. Research runs can use a lot of your usage; we haven&#039;t tested his exact setup.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/nexor404/status/2112588347868627007" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @nexor404 on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-ten-hypotheses-research-prompt/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Copy%20the%20%27one%20lead%2C%2010%20sub-agents%2C%20one%20checker%27%20research%20setup%20into%20Grok%20Bot%20%28prompt%20included%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-ten-hypotheses-research-prompt%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
            <button type="button" data-copy-text="Take this question as one problem. Write 10 hypotheses, give each to its own sub-agent, check every claim against real data, cut the weak ones and hand me the top 3 with sources. Build nothing." class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200">Copy prompt</button>
    </div>
