                                <article id="argon-wizard-chess-antigravity" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="coding">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Coding</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-19" class="text-slate-400">Oct 19, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/argon-wizard-chess-antigravity/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Google built a playable 3D Wizard Chess game with Gemini 4 Argon. Here&#039;s how to try it</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google&#039;s Gemini team showed off a playable 3D Wizard Chess game it built from scratch with Gemini 4 Argon, using Google Antigravity inside the Gemini app for Mac. Several agents worked together in Blender to model the pieces, design the board and create smooth real-time animations, taking the game from idea to playable. Antigravity in the Gemini app plans the build step by step, lets you comment on the plan before it starts, and only works inside folders you choose.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A single chat can now drive a whole 3D art and animation pipeline, not just write code. That opens small games and interactive projects to people who don&#039;t know Blender.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Mac users who want to build small games, 3D scenes or interactive prototypes.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Latest Gemini app for Mac, in English, for users 18 and over. Google says Argon in Antigravity is for Google AI Ultra subscribers. Argon in the regular Gemini app is on AI Pro and Ultra.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/GeminiApp/status/2112214581443498261" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @GeminiApp on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/gemini/argon-wizard-chess-antigravity/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
