    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Productivity</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-19" class="text-slate-400">Oct 19, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/canvas-apps-to-google-sites/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Turn a Gemini Canvas app into a live Google Site in one click</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Interactive apps you build in Gemini&#039;s Canvas can now be exported straight to Google Sites. Pick Export &gt; Google Sites and the working app lands in a new private site draft, where you can add text and pages, then publish and share it like any other Site. There&#039;s no code to copy and nothing to host yourself, so a quiz, calculator or booking form made by chatting with Gemini can be live for your team, customers or students in minutes.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> The hard part of a quick AI-built tool is getting it in front of people. This closes that gap with a site you already know how to share.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Teachers, small businesses and teams who build small tools in Gemini and need a link to share.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Available now on web, Android and iOS for Workspace customers, Workspace Individual and personal Google accounts with the Gemini app, if you&#039;re allowed to create Google Sites.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/publish-interactive-apps-from-gemini-app-to-Google-Sites.html" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: Google Workspace on workspaceupdates.googleblog.com ↗</a>
