    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-runs-new-business-roemmele/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Brian Roemmele says Grok Bot turned one question into a business it now runs</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">In a post seen by close to half a million people, Brian Roemmele says he asked Grok Bot about a problem encoding video and audio for AI, and it brainstormed him into a whole new venture that it now runs. He says the Bot has set up seven roles it fills itself, answers every customer by email, and has brought in $700 without much effort. Others on X are trying the same thing with free side-business templates.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s one of the clearest public examples of people handing an agent the day-to-day running of a small business, not just a single task.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Builders and side-hustlers curious how far an always-on agent can go with a small online business.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot comes with The X Subscription from the $30/month Premium tier up (since Oct 12). Existing SuperGrok and Cursor subscribers can keep their plan or switch in billing settings. Results are his own report and will vary.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/2111636586735501464" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @BrianRoemmele on X ↗</a>
