                                <article id="bot-trade-veto-checklist-paper" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="agents">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Agents</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-18" class="text-slate-400">Oct 18, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-trade-veto-checklist-paper/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A trader&#039;s 10-skill Grok Bot checklist where any single &#039;no&#039; kills the trade (paper only)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A trader on X shared 10 free Grok Bot skills that work as a pre-trade checklist, each with one job. They check that the possible reward is at least twice the risk, size each position to 1% risk, trade only with the 4-hour trend, skip trades near big news, keep stops away from liquidation clusters, log every trade and turn each loss into a new rule. If any one skill says no, the trade is blocked. The post claims big gains. We don&#039;t repeat or rely on them, and past results don&#039;t predict future ones. What&#039;s interesting is the design: the AI acts as a sceptic that blocks bad ideas, and the person still gives the final yes. This is not investment advice. Use paper trading only.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Most AI trading demos try to find trades. This one uses the agent to stop impulsive ones, which is a safer way to experiment.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People practising trading discipline on a paper account who want an automatic rules check.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">The skills are free on GitHub under an MIT licence. Grok Bot needs a plan that includes it. Use a paper-trading account only; we haven&#039;t tested the skills.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/alpha404ai/status/2111880490189742539" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @alpha404ai on X ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-trade-veto-checklist-paper/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=A%20trader%27s%2010-skill%20Grok%20Bot%20checklist%20where%20any%20single%20%27no%27%20kills%20the%20trade%20%28paper%20only%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fbot-trade-veto-checklist-paper%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
