    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google announced on August 19 that eligible US college students get 12 months of Google AI Pro free. Google values it at $19.99 a month, and it includes higher Gemini limits, Gemini in Gmail and Docs, and 5 TB of storage. In more than 140 other markets, students can get a year of Google AI Plus instead. You must redeem by December 31, 2026. We checked the terms were still live on October 17.</p>
