            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">College students aged 18 and over. AI Pro is for US students; AI Plus is for eligible students in 140+ other markets.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free for 12 months, then $19.99/month (AI Pro) unless you cancel. Needs a personal Google account, SheerID verification and a payment method. Not available on school Workspace accounts.</dd></div>        </dl>
