    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">The free, open-source MCP for Blender project (formerly blender-mcp) connects an AI agent to Blender. Once it&#039;s set up you can ask Claude Code to create and change objects, apply materials and colours, build whole scenes and then inspect and refine them in plain English. Its installer also sets up Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, VS Code and Antigravity.</p>
