        <a href="/trending/claude/slides-decks/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Build slide decks with Claude Slides instead of hunting for templates</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Boris Cherny, who leads Claude Code at Anthropic, says Claude Slides is now how he makes decks, including the device-frame mockups he used to search for by hand. Slides lives in the Claude app alongside Claude Docs and Claude Design, so you can draft a one-pager, turn it into a deck and mock up a matching visual in one conversation.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> You can go from notes to a finished deck with mockups without leaving Claude or hunting for device frames.</p>
