    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">An OpenAI engineer used his dot to triage a 3am on-call incident: the dot investigated the issue and started a Codex thread, and he steered the fix from his phone in the ChatGPT app. It shows how dots and Codex hand work to each other so you do not need a laptop to start an investigation.</p>
