    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/gpt-live-voice-design/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Shape a custom voice for your app with a prompt (GPT-Live-1)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">OpenAI Developers published a guide on giving GPT-Live-1 apps a voice that fits: you can shape a voice with a prompt or choose from new international preset voices. Useful if your voice agent sounds generic or wrong for your audience.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> A voice that matches your brand and market makes a voice agent feel trustworthy instead of robotic.</p>
