    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">With Gemini 4 Argon, Canvas can turn a dense PDF into an interactive, animated web app you can explore at your own pace. It is a great way to make a research paper, manual or report actually readable.</p>
