    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">As of October 16, Google AI Pro subscribers can build with Gemini 4 Argon in AI Studio Build and the Playground. Before that it was limited to paid API and Ultra subscribers. It is the cheapest way to prototype small apps with Argon if you already pay for AI Pro.</p>
