    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cursor cloud agents can now build interactive canvases. You can ask for a dashboard or report while the agent works, then share the finished canvas with your team as a link.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> You get a shareable visual of the agent&#039;s work, so teammates can review results without reading logs or diffs.</p>
                <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><li>Start a Cursor cloud agent on a task.</li><li>Ask it to &quot;build a canvas showing test coverage by module&quot; as part of the run.</li><li>Share the canvas link with your team.</li></ol>
                <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Teams using Cursor cloud agents for reports, audits or refactors.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Cursor cloud agents; see Cursor&#039;s pricing page for plan limits.</dd></div>        </dl>
