        <a href="/trending/claude/mythos-quantum-circuits/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Mythos 5 designs more efficient quantum circuits</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">From Anthropic&#039;s STEM Fellows Program: given plain-language instructions, Claude Mythos 5 designed quantum circuits that beat the best published ones, sometimes by an order of magnitude or more. More efficient circuits need fewer resources, which could bring quantum applications in chemistry and materials science closer.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows Claude doing original technical design work that researchers can check, not just summarising papers.</p>
