        <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes#chatgpt-slides" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @OpenAI on help.openai.com ↗</a>
