    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/premarket-brief-paper/" class="hover:text-brand-600">A Grok Bot that learns your style and writes your pre-market brief</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A trader says he spent an hour one-on-one with one of his Grok Bots, set up as a trading-desk assistant. He says it picked up his style, made recommendations, and logged into his Alpaca paper-trading account. He plans to have it read a favourite analyst&#039;s posts before his daily 6 AM pre-market brief. Paper trading only in the original post. This is a look at what people are building, not investment advice: automated trading can lose money fast.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows the &#039;teammate&#039; side of Grok Bot: it remembers how you work and does the morning reading for you.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People who already follow markets and want a research assistant. Not a replacement for your own judgement.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot comes with The X Subscription from the $30/month Premium tier up (since Oct 12). Existing SuperGrok and Cursor subscribers can keep their plan or switch in billing settings. Alpaca offers free paper-trading accounts.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/misupoalsupo/status/2111207851465040365" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @misupoalsupo on X ↗</a>
