    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-subscription-killer-prompt/" class="hover:text-brand-600">This Grok Bot prompt reads your invoices and builds cheaper replacements for your subscriptions</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Builder shawnbuilds shared a monthly prompt that has Grok Bot check his Gmail invoices, pick subscriptions it thinks it could compete with, build a small team of Bots to copy the one or two core features, and have a separate evaluation Bot blind-test the results. He says it flagged a $399-a-month AI SEO tool, and after a lot of feedback his Bot setup reached what he estimates is about 80% of the quality for roughly $45 a month.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Most people pay for tools where they use only one or two features. Pointing an agent at your invoices is a concrete way to find the ones you could replace yourself.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Founders and freelancers with a pile of SaaS subscriptions and a Grok Bot plan.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Works with any Grok Bot plan that can connect to Gmail. Results depend heavily on the tool you&#039;re replacing and how much feedback you give. His numbers are his own estimates.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: reported by users on X; we haven&#039;t independently confirmed it works in the current version.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/shawnbuilds/status/2111103275684733147" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @shawnbuilds on X ↗</a>
