    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-16" class="text-slate-400">Oct 16, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/design-standalone-closes-dec-14/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Standalone Claude Design closes Dec 14: export your projects now</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Claude Code 2.1.302 added a notice to /design-sync and /design-login that the standalone Claude Design site at claude.ai/design closes by December 14, 2026. Anthropic&#039;s Nate Parrott said on October 8 that Design is being folded into the Claude app, where the built-in Design and Slides get much more use, and asked people to report anything the new version is missing.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you have prototypes or mockups in the standalone Design site, you have under two months to move or export them before it shuts.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Designers, founders and developers who built prototypes in claude.ai/design or sync them into Claude Code.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Applies to standalone Claude Design users on any Claude plan. Design keeps working inside the Claude app.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#21302" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on github.com ↗</a>
