    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic opened applications for two fellowships: STEM Fellows (science and engineering) and Conceptual Reasoning Fellows (philosophy, cognitive science, economics, policy and law). Fellows spend four months at Anthropic from January 2027 helping Claude reason well about hard problems in their fields. Applications close on October 28.</p>
