    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">One builder says he runs a memecoin trading desk on Grok Bot all day, every day, on paper only. He says it scouts new coins, checks influencer mentions, and on October 13 logged 2,569 skips with a reason for each, with only 188 coins clearing the first screen. The Bot never buys without his &quot;GO&quot;. He shared a free template. Paper trading only in the original post. This is a look at what people are building, not investment advice: automated trading can lose money fast.</p>
