            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Curious Grok Bot users who want to see an always-on research agent at work. Not for anyone looking for a money machine.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Grok Bot comes with The X Subscription from the $30/month Premium tier up (since Oct 12). Existing SuperGrok and Cursor subscribers can keep their plan or switch in billing settings. Paper trading only.</dd></div>        </dl>
