    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/bot-spam-call-scrubber/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Sick of spam calls? A free Grok Bot skill hunts down your number and files the opt-outs for you</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Arash got fed up with spam calls, so he had his Grok Bot find where his phone number was listed on people-search and data-broker sites and file the removal requests. He then published it as a free template called Spam-Call Scrubber. Its listing says it submits the opt-outs, finishes the email confirmations and re-checks the sites on a schedule you pick. The post passed 4.6 million views and 15,000 bookmarks in three days.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Data-broker opt-outs are tedious, multi-step chores that most people never finish, and this is exactly the kind of boring, repeatable job an always-on agent can grind through.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Anyone drowning in spam calls or texts who already has Grok Bot.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free community template in the Grok Bot marketplace (made by a user, not by xAI). Needs a Grok Bot plan. How much gets removed depends on each site and on the privacy laws where you live.</dd></div>        </dl>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Note: this is a community-made template, not built by xAI. Users on X report mixed results depending on where they live, and we haven&#039;t independently confirmed how well it works.</p>    <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
