                                <article id="argon-cornhole-robot" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="gemini" data-cat="research">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">Gemini</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Research</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-13" class="text-slate-400">Oct 13, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/gemini/argon-cornhole-robot/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Gemini 4 Argon taught a humanoid robot to play cornhole from a video</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Google DeepMind says Gemini 4 Argon watched a video of cornhole, worked out the physics, wrote its own simulation and used it to teach Apptronik&#039;s Apollo humanoid robot, which then landed seven throws in a row.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It shows a model going from watching to simulating to controlling a real robot, a step towards robots that learn new tasks quickly.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Robotics engineers, researchers and anyone tracking where AI agents are heading.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Research demo from Google DeepMind; not a consumer feature.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110078384617464201" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @GoogleDeepMind on X ↗</a>
