        <time datetime="2026-10-13" class="text-slate-400">Oct 13, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/startups-cohort-full/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Claude Startups&#039; $7,000 perk pack filled up in a week. Here&#039;s what&#039;s still open</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">On October 6, Anthropic expanded Claude Startups: a free year of Claude Team (up to five Premium seats), a one-time $1,000 API credit (up to $7,000 in total, by Anthropic&#039;s count) and partner offers it values at up to $45,000. Startups founded in the last five years or funded in the last two were eligible. Demand was far higher than Anthropic expected, and on October 13 it said the cohort was full and new applications were closed. Forbes reported backlash from founders who missed out.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you were planning to apply, the main offer is paused. But there are still two routes to Claude credits.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Early-stage founders building on Claude.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">New applications are closed (checked Oct 17). Current members keep their benefits. Founders backed by a VC in Anthropic&#039;s partner network may get up to $100K in API credits through that VC. Credits only work in the first-party Claude Console, not on AWS, Google Cloud or Azure.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://claude.com/programs/startups" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @Anthropic on claude.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/startups-cohort-full/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
