    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Meta launched Muse Wonder, its new frontier model family, on October 12. In the Muse app, Wonder powers the assistant for subscribers on the $20 Power or $100 Maximum plan, and the free tier stays on Muse Spark 1.3. Meta is rolling it out in waves, so it may not show up right away.</p>
