            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Muse users deciding whether to upgrade.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Muse Power ($20) and Maximum ($100) plans; rolling out in waves.</dd></div>        </dl>
