    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">For developers, Muse Wonder is available in Muse Code and the Meta Model API at $4 input and $20 output per million tokens. Muse Wonder Full is only available on Muse Code&#039;s Power and Maximum subscription plans. Meta pitches both for frontier coding, long-running agents and computer use.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Developers can use Muse Wonder in Meta&#039;s own coding agent or through the API at a published price.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers evaluating Meta&#039;s models for coding agents.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Muse Code and Meta Model API ($4/$20 per M tokens). Wonder Full only on Muse Code Power and Maximum.</dd></div>        </dl>
