    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">A community benchmark that has AI models play Pokémon Red started a live run with Muse Wonder on launch day. The account says Muse Spark 1.3 previously used all 1,000 turns and only reached Viridian Forest, and that the record is held by GPT-6.1 Sol at 244 turns, with the same prompt and setup for every run.</p>
