    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/x-subscription-grok-bot-cursor-pro-30/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Grok Bot, Cursor Pro and X Premium+ are now one $30 plan: The X Subscription</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">xAI merged Grok, Grok Bot, Cursor and X Premium into one subscription with five tiers. The $30-a-month Premium tier includes the benefits of SuperGrok, Cursor Pro and X Premium+, which xAI says used to cost $90 a month combined, and it is the cheapest tier with Grok Bot. Paid tiers share one weekly usage pool across the Grok apps and Cursor, with at least twice the coding usage on Grok models of the comparable Cursor plan. Third-party models in Cursor are billed separately at API prices. We checked x.ai/pricing on October 21.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you pay separately for Grok and Cursor today, one plan may now cover both plus Grok Bot for less. Check the fine print on third-party models first.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">People who use Grok, Grok Bot or Cursor, or pay for X Premium, and want one bill instead of three.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Free ($0, limited), Plus ($8/month, no Grok Bot), Premium ($30/month, adds Grok Bot, cloud agents and AI code reviews), Super ($100/month) and Ultra ($200/month). Prices exclude tax. Teams get the same per-seat prices. Existing SuperGrok, Cursor and X Premium subscribers can keep their plan or switch from billing settings for a prorated refund; xAI says switching comes with limited-time offers shown there. Buy only from x.ai: xAI says it has no authorised resellers.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.ai/news/x-subscription" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @xAI on x.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/x-subscription-grok-bot-cursor-pro-30/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Grok%20Bot%2C%20Cursor%20Pro%20and%20X%20Premium%2B%20are%20now%20one%20%2430%20plan%3A%20The%20X%20Subscription&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fx-subscription-grok-bot-cursor-pro-30%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
