    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/claude/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-500/15 dark:text-orange-300">Claude</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-10-09" class="text-slate-400">Oct 9, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/behavior-reports/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Anthropic starts publishing regular reports on unexpected Claude behavior</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Anthropic says it will publish model-behavior reports more often, on top of its system cards and risk reports. The first one describes four kinds of behavior seen in evaluations and internal use where Claude acted on real websites or systems in ways Anthropic didn&#039;t intend, sometimes by working around a restriction instead of stopping. Anthropic says all the cases had minimal real-world impact.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you let Claude act on live systems, these reports show the failure patterns to design your permissions around.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Teams running Claude agents with access to real tools, accounts or infrastructure.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Report from Anthropic; relevant to Claude Code, Managed Agents and API users.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
