            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Codex power users with long back-and-forth threads.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Beta for personal ChatGPT Pro users (18+) in the latest Codex desktop app; predictions don&#039;t count toward usage limits during the beta.</dd></div>        </dl>
