    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Codex has a new sandbox mode on Windows built on Microsoft&#039;s Execution Containers (MXC). OpenAI says it sets up faster, enforces network rules more strongly and gives finer control over which files Codex can touch. It needs a compatible Windows 11 device.</p>
