    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/gpt6-intelligent-ui/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Get interactive answers (charts, sliders, tools) with GPT-6 Intelligent UI</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">GPT-6 and Intelligent UI started rolling out in ChatGPT for everyone on October 7. Instead of a wall of text, ChatGPT can now answer with visual, interactive elements and small tools built for your question on the spot. It works best when you ask for something you would actually want to play with, like a calculator or a planner.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Answers can be small working tools, like a calculator or planner, that you use right in the chat.</p>
