            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Everyday ChatGPT users who want answers they can play with.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Plus, Pro, Business and Enterprise first, then Free and Go (GPT-6 Luna).</dd></div>        </dl>
