    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/pm-top-users-artifact/" class="hover:text-brand-600">PM trick: find your top users and book calls in one prompt</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Cat Wu, who works on Claude Code at Anthropic, shared one of her favourite product-manager uses for Claude: ask who used a feature the most last week, have Claude build an artifact of the top 10 users by usage, then have it reach out and set up 15-minute calls. She calls it the fastest way to get user feedback.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Talking to your heaviest users is the best feedback loop a PM has, and this turns hours of querying and emailing into one request.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Product managers and founders who have usage data and connected email or calendar tools.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Needs Claude connected to your analytics source and to email or calendar; check what your plan&#039;s connectors allow.</dd></div>        </dl>
