        <a href="/trending/chatgpt/virtual-try-on/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Try clothes on virtually while you shop in ChatGPT</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Product listings for clothes and accessories in ChatGPT now have a Try on button. Take or upload a selfie and ChatGPT Images shows how the item could look on you. Your reference photo is saved for future try-ons, and you can change or delete it under Settings &gt; Personalization &gt; Reference photos. You can also save products to Favorites or to folders in your Library.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It gives you a quick idea of fit and style before you buy, without leaving the chat where you&#039;re comparing options.</p>
