        <time datetime="2026-10-02" class="text-slate-400">Oct 2, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        Scan multi-page notes into one PDF with the ChatGPT camera    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">The ChatGPT camera on iPhone can now scan several pages in a row and combine them into one PDF, ready to upload to your chat. Open the camera in ChatGPT, tap the three-dot menu and choose Scan.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> Handwritten notes, receipts and printed handouts go straight into ChatGPT as one document instead of a pile of photos.</p>
                <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><li>Open the camera in the ChatGPT iOS app, tap the three-dot menu and choose Scan.</li><li>Capture each page in order.</li><li>Ask: &quot;Turn these notes into a clean outline and a list of open questions.&quot;</li></ol>
                <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Students, people working with paper forms, and anyone digitising notes.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Rolling out on iOS.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes#scan" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @OpenAI on help.openai.com ↗</a>
