    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-mods/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Change how Claude Code works with mods (or ask Claude to write one)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Since October 1, Claude Code supports mods: small TypeScript functions that hook into its events. A mod can rewrite a prompt before it reaches the model, block or retry a tool call, redact secrets from tool output, or add buttons and panes to the terminal or desktop app. Mods ship inside plugins. They are not sandboxed and run with the same access as Claude Code, so only install ones from sources you trust.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> You can change how Claude Code behaves with a few lines of TypeScript, including adding your own safety checks.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Developers and teams who want to customise or lock down Claude Code.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Claude Code CLI and desktop app (since Oct 1, 2026). Mods aren&#039;t sandboxed, so install only trusted ones.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-code-mods" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @claudeai on claude.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/claude/code-mods/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Change%20how%20Claude%20Code%20works%20with%20mods%20%28or%20ask%20Claude%20to%20write%20one%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fclaude%2Fcode-mods%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
</div>
</article>
                                <article id="charm-device" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="muse" data-cat="news">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/muse/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/15 dark:text-violet-300">Muse</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Industry News</span>
        <time datetime="2026-09-23" class="text-slate-400">Sep 23, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/muse/charm-device/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Meta shows the Muse Charm, a pocket device for Muse</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">At Meta Connect, Mark Zuckerberg briefly showed the Muse Charm, a palm-sized device just for the Muse agent. The Verge describes a big screen, a fingerprint sensor you press to talk, a small camera and microphones. Zuckerberg said you won&#039;t need to unlock a phone to use it and that Meta plans to ship it in time for the December holidays. Price wasn&#039;t announced.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> It&#039;s Meta&#039;s bet that a personal agent deserves its own device, alongside its glasses.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Early adopters and anyone deciding whether to wait for Muse hardware.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Applies to:</dt> <dd class="inline">Not on sale yet; Meta says December 2026.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/999750/muse-charm-meta-ai-hardware" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: The Verge on www.theverge.com ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/muse/charm-device/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">Read more →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Meta%20shows%20the%20Muse%20Charm%2C%20a%20pocket%20device%20for%20Muse&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fmuse%2Fcharm-device%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
    </div>
</div>
</article>
                                <article id="included-free-in-plans" class="card flex flex-col p-6 scroll-mt-28" data-trend data-ai="grok" data-cat="deals">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <a href="/trending/grok/" class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-white">Grok Bot</a>        <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-medium text-slate-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300">Free offers &amp; deals</span>
        <time datetime="2026-08-26" class="text-slate-400">Aug 26, 2026</time>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink dark:text-white">
        <a href="/trending/grok/included-free-in-plans/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Grok Bot was added to SuperGrok and Cursor plans (now sold as The X Subscription)</a>    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">xAI expanded Grok Bot, its always-on AI teammates that get their own cloud computer and sign into your apps, to every SuperGrok plan and to Cursor Pro, Pro+, Ultra and all Cursor Teams plans. xAI says Grok Bot comes with its own usage, so work you hand to a Bot doesn&#039;t eat into your Grok or Cursor limits. Update: since October 12, 2026, new customers get Grok Bot through The X Subscription instead, from the $30/month Premium tier, which bundles SuperGrok, Cursor Pro and X Premium+ benefits (x.ai/news/x-subscription).</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400"><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Why it matters:</strong> If you already pay for one of these older plans, you may have a 24/7 agent you haven&#039;t tried yet. xAI says nothing changes for existing SuperGrok and Cursor subscribers.</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Good for:</dt> <dd class="inline">Existing SuperGrok and Cursor Pro or Teams subscribers, and anyone comparing plans for Grok Bot.</dd></div>            <div><dt class="inline font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-300">Plan &amp; availability:</dt> <dd class="inline">Existing SuperGrok, SuperGrok Plus and Heavy, Cursor Pro, Pro+ and Ultra, and Cursor Teams subscribers keep Grok Bot and can stay on their plan or switch in billing settings. New buyers: The X Subscription, Premium ($30/month) or higher.</dd></div>        </dl>
            <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5 text-sm">
        <a href="https://x.ai/news/grok-bot-more-plans" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Source: @xAI on x.ai ↗</a>
        <a href="/trending/grok/included-free-in-plans/" class="font-semibold text-brand-600">How to try it →</a>    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-4 dark:border-white/5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" data-share>
    <a href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=Grok%20Bot%20was%20added%20to%20SuperGrok%20and%20Cursor%20plans%20%28now%20sold%20as%20The%20X%20Subscription%29&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fagentstacklist.com%2Ftrending%2Fgrok%2Fincluded-free-in-plans%2F%3Futm_source%3Dx%26utm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_campaign%3Dshare" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-share-x class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:border-white/15 dark:text-zinc-200"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-3.5 fill-current"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>Share on X</a>
