<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-20" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
    <h2 id="faq-h" class="text-center font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="hs-accordion-group mt-8 space-y-3">
                    <div class="hs-accordion card active" id="faq-0">
                <button class="hs-accordion-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-c-0">
                    <h3>Where do these AI tips and tricks come from?</h3><span class="text-brand-500 transition hs-accordion-active:rotate-45">+</span>
                </button>
                <div id="faq-c-0" class="hs-accordion-content  overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" role="region">
                    <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">From official announcements and release notes by OpenAI, Anthropic, Google and Meta, and from popular posts on X by people who use these tools every day. We rewrite each item in our own words and link the original post or page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="hs-accordion card " id="faq-1">
                <button class="hs-accordion-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-c-1">
                    <h3>How often is this page updated?</h3><span class="text-brand-500 transition hs-accordion-active:rotate-45">+</span>
                </button>
                <div id="faq-c-1" class="hs-accordion-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" role="region">
                    <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">We add new items most days. Each item shows the date it was announced and the date we last checked it, and the RSS and JSON feeds update with every build.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="hs-accordion card " id="faq-2">
                <button class="hs-accordion-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-c-2">
                    <h3>What is Meta Muse?</h3><span class="text-brand-500 transition hs-accordion-active:rotate-45">+</span>
                </button>
                <div id="faq-c-2" class="hs-accordion-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" role="region">
                    <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Muse is Meta&#039;s personal AI agent, launched in September 2026, with its own model family (Muse Wonder and Muse Spark). See the Muse page for what it can do.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="hs-accordion card " id="faq-3">
                <button class="hs-accordion-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-c-3">
                    <h3>What are prompt packs?</h3><span class="text-brand-500 transition hs-accordion-active:rotate-45">+</span>
                </button>
                <div id="faq-c-3" class="hs-accordion-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" role="region">
                    <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Prompts that people have shared and tested for a specific job, like Nano Banana image series or a Muse ads audit. We describe what each one does and link the original so you can copy it.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="hs-accordion card " id="faq-4">
                <button class="hs-accordion-toggle flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-c-4">
                    <h3>What if a trick doesn&#039;t work for me?</h3><span class="text-brand-500 transition hs-accordion-active:rotate-45">+</span>
                </button>
                <div id="faq-c-4" class="hs-accordion-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" role="region">
                    <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Features roll out by plan and region, so check the availability line on each item. Some tips come from users on X and we haven&#039;t confirmed them in the current version; those end with a short note saying so. If something is wrong, tell us.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
</section>
