        <h2 class="relative mt-5 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Get the week&#039;s best AI tricks</h2>
        <p class="relative mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-400">What changed in Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot and Antigravity: limits, pricing, new MCP servers and the tools that actually work, with honest notes.</p>
