<section class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl px-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
    <p><strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-zinc-200">How we pick these:</strong> we read official announcements and popular posts on X, check each claim against the original source, and rewrite it in our own words. We link the source on every item and never make up features. Tips from users that we couldn't confirm ourselves end with a short note saying so. We leave out jailbreaks, ways around an AI's safety rules, harassment and anything illegal. Spot a mistake? <a class="text-brand-600 underline" href="/submit/">Tell us</a>.</p>
